            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "QqHF8",
              "name": "SegmentItem Documentation",
              "width": 640,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": "$spacing-lg",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "YdtS9",
                  "name": "Docs Title",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-header",
                  "content": "SegmentItem",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-xl",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-xl",
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Qa5bg",
                  "name": "Docs Subtitle",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-meta",
                  "content": "Selection Atom",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "QQppd",
                  "name": "Purpose",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Purpose\nA single pill-shaped segment used inside a SegmentedControl molecule. Each SegmentItem represents one mutually exclusive option. The selected state uses a white raised pill with a subtle shadow over the gray container background. Unlike TabItem (underline navigation), SegmentItem is for mode or value switching within a compact control.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "GdWAF",
                  "name": "When to use",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When to use\n• Switching between 2–4 mutually exclusive modes (e.g. Monthly / Quarterly / Yearly)\n• Compact filter or view toggle inside a toolbar or card header\n• Any context where all options should be visible at once and only one is active",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "w2Kq3K",
                  "name": "When not",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When NOT to use\n• Page-level or section-level navigation (use TabItem / TabsGroup)\n• Boolean on/off toggle (use ToggleSwitch)\n• Actions or commands (use Button)\n• Selecting from more than 4–5 options (use Select or Radio)\n• Multi-select filtering (use Tags or Checkboxes)",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "M0Hyt7",
                  "name": "Variants",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Variants & defaults\n• state: default (default) · hover · selected · disabled\n• size: md (only size for now)\n\n4 component variants:\n  SegmentItem · SegmentItem/hover · SegmentItem/selected · SegmentItem/disabled\n\nDefault uses $colors-text-body text, no background. Hover uses $colors-text-header (darker text), no background. Selected uses $colors-text-header semibold text, white pill background with shadow. Disabled uses $colors-text-disabled, no background.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Orp4A",
                  "name": "Tokens",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Token usage\n• Height: 40 px, cornerRadius: $radius-full (pill)\n• Padding: [0, $spacing-md] horizontal\n• Layout: horizontal, alignItems center, justifyContent center\n• Resizing: SegmentItem accepts width overrides. In a fill-width SegmentedControl, each item uses fill_container so the selected background, shadow, and label centering all scale with the segment width.\n• Default: transparent bg, text $colors-text-body, typo-primary-sm-regular\n• Hover: transparent bg, text $colors-text-header, typo-primary-sm-regular\n• Selected: fill $colors-background-surface (white), text $colors-text-header, typo-primary-sm-semibold, shadow $shadow-sm (shadow-sm-y / shadow-sm-blur / shadow-sm-color), radius $radius-full\n• Disabled: transparent bg, text $colors-text-disabled, typo-primary-sm-regular\n• Transitions: $duration-fast + $easing-standard",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "tS4Nf",
                  "name": "A11y",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Accessibility\nSegmentItem maps to a radio button within a radiogroup or a tab within a tablist, depending on context. Use role=\"radio\" with aria-checked or role=\"tab\" with aria-selected. Disabled segments should have aria-disabled=\"true\". Keyboard: arrow keys to move between segments, Enter/Space to activate. Focus must be clearly visible on the active segment.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
