            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "YYbqo",
              "name": "Steps Documentation",
              "width": 640,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": "$spacing-lg",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "B8WHeS",
                  "name": "Docs Title",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-header",
                  "content": "Steps",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-xl",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-xl",
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "FNVwE",
                  "name": "Docs Subtitle",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-meta",
                  "content": "P2 Progress / Navigation Molecule",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "VuwXk",
                  "name": "Purpose",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Purpose\nA stateless visual step indicator for onboarding, settings, and multi-step flows. Steps displays progress through a sequence — it does not manage wizard state, routing, or navigation. The current step is controlled by props/state in implementation.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "j6qf6D",
                  "name": "When to use",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When to use\n• Multi-step forms (onboarding, checkout, account setup)\n• Settings wizards with sequential sections\n• Any flow where users need to see their position and remaining steps",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "iEqok",
                  "name": "When not to use",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When NOT to use\n• Tab navigation where any tab can be reached directly (use TabItem)\n• Progress bars showing continuous completion percentage\n• Breadcrumbs for page hierarchy navigation\n• Single-page forms without distinct sections",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "wOLxn",
                  "name": "Variants",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Variants / defaults\n• orientation: horizontal (default) | vertical\n• step count: 3 (default) | 4 | 5\n• labels: true (default) | false\n• Step item states: completed (filled + check), current (ring + dot), upcoming (muted ring)\n• Connectors after completed steps use active color; before upcoming steps use muted color",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "jNfvd",
                  "name": "Token usage",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Token usage\n• Indicator: 24×24, cornerRadius 9999 (fully round)\n• Completed: fill $blue-600, check icon lucide 14×14, $colors-text-reverse\n• Current: stroke $blue-600 (2 px), inner dot 10×10 $blue-600\n• Upcoming: stroke $colors-borders-light (1 px)\n• Active connector: Separator ref, $blue-600 fill\n• Muted connector: Separator ref, $colors-borders-light fill (default)\n• Label completed: typo-primary-sm-regular + $colors-text-body\n• Label current: typo-primary-sm-semibold + $colors-text-header\n• Label upcoming: typo-primary-sm-regular + $colors-text-meta\n• Step column gap: $spacing-2xs between track and label\n• Vertical rail gap: $spacing-3xs, connector height 20 px",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "gRqcP",
                  "name": "Accessibility",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Accessibility\nSteps is a visual indicator only. In implementation, the current step should expose aria-current=\"step\" and the consuming flow owns focus management and navigation. Each step label should be readable by assistive technology. Completed steps should convey their state (e.g. via aria-label \"Step 1, completed\").",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
