            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "bAWY6",
              "name": "TabsGroup Documentation",
              "width": 640,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 32,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "nhFLU",
                  "name": "Docs Title",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-header",
                  "content": "TabsGroup",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-xl",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-xl",
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "fyPMc",
                  "name": "Docs Subtitle",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-meta",
                  "content": "Tabbed Navigation Molecule",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "hhaVs",
                  "name": "Purpose",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Purpose\nA horizontal group of TabItem atoms that forms a resizable navigational tab bar with a bottom divider. TabsGroup distributes tab items across its width via fill_container sizing, shows the active tab's blue underline indicator above a 1 px $colors-borders-light divider, and supports disabled tabs. When resized wider or narrower, tabs redistribute evenly and indicators remain full-width. Routing and panel management are handled by implementation.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "mrDYB",
                  "name": "When to use",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When to use\n• Switch between related content views within a page section\n• Organize settings, filters, or dashboard panels into tabs\n• Provide top-level navigation within a Card or panel\n• Display 2–4 peer-level views where only one is active at a time",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "euc6A",
                  "name": "When not to use",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When NOT to use\n• Primary site navigation (use a Nav bar or sidebar)\n• More than 4–5 items (consider a Select or overflow menu)\n• Filtering that allows multiple active selections (use Tags or Checkboxes)\n• Stepper or wizard flows (use Steps component)\n• Single toggle between two states (use ToggleSwitch)",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "emU1t",
                  "name": "Variants",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Variants / Defaults\n• itemCount: 2 | 3 | 4  →  3\n• selected: first | middle | last  →  first\n• disabledItem: false | true  →  false\n\nVariant naming:\n• /2-tabs — two-item tab group\n• /mid-selected — middle tab selected\n• /last-selected — last tab selected\n• /4-tabs — four-item tab group (second selected)\n• /with-disabled — includes one disabled tab\n\nAll variants use width 400 px default. TabItem instances use fill_container width to distribute evenly. Resizable by overriding the group width.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "fMuLI",
                  "name": "Token usage",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Token usage\n• Layout = horizontal, alignItems center\n• Gap between tabs = $spacing-2xs (8 px)\n• Width = fit-content (determined by tab count and label widths)\n• Tab default = TabItem atom ($colors-borders-light stroke, $gray-800 text)\n• Tab selected = TabItem/selected ($gray-800 fill, $base-white text, semibold)\n• Tab disabled = TabItem/disabled ($colors-text-disabled text)\n• Tab shape = pill (cornerRadius 9999, inherited from TabItem)\n• Tab padding = [8, 16] (inherited from TabItem)",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "WYXQh",
                  "name": "Accessibility",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Accessibility\nTabsGroup should be implemented with the WAI-ARIA tablist pattern. The container should have role=\"tablist\". Each TabItem should have role=\"tab\" with aria-selected=\"true\" on the active tab and aria-selected=\"false\" on others. Keyboard navigation should support left/right arrow keys to move between tabs, Home/End to jump to first/last tab, and Enter or Space to activate. Disabled tabs should have aria-disabled=\"true\" and be skipped by arrow-key navigation. Each tab panel should be linked to its tab via aria-controls and aria-labelledby.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "kpN9v",
          "name": "TabsGroup Demo Examples Title",
