            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "Uwrcq",
              "name": "DatePicker Documentation",
              "width": 640,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 32,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "obrMz",
                  "name": "Docs Title",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-header",
                  "content": "DatePicker",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-xl",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-xl",
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "MK0LN",
                  "name": "Docs Subtitle",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-meta",
                  "content": "Date Selection Form Control Molecule",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "MDhkS",
                  "name": "Purpose",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Purpose\nDatePicker is a form control molecule for selecting or entering a single date. It combines an Input-style date field, calendar icon button, validation messaging, and a calendar popover.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "MLwMw",
                  "name": "When to use",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When to use\n• Date selection in forms\n• Birth date, transfer date, appointment date, or scheduled action date\n• Cases where users may type a date or pick one from a calendar\n• When calendar selection improves accuracy over free text input",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "C5YfU",
                  "name": "When not to use",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When NOT to use\n• Date ranges, unless a separate range picker is provided\n• Time selection\n• Recurring schedule rules\n• Free-form natural language dates\n• Calendar-heavy scheduling flows that need a full calendar view",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "sYTbb",
                  "name": "Variants",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Variants / Defaults\n• state: default / filled / focus / disabled / error / open\n• label: true / false\n• description: false / true\n• error: false / true\n• value: empty / filled\n• default: label true, empty value, state default",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "wvgz2",
                  "name": "Implementation note",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Implementation note\nDatePicker should align with the existing React Aria DatePicker implementation. The dev component is based on React Aria DatePicker and composes:\n• DatePicker wrapper\n• Label\n• FieldGroup\n• DateInput\n• FieldButton with CalendarIcon\n• Description\n• FieldError\n• Popover\n• Calendar",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Uj6cb",
                  "name": "Token usage",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Token usage\nThe DatePicker field uses the same visual styling as Input:\n• Same field height (58 px)\n• Same floating label behavior (base-regular centered when empty, xs-semibold floated at y:12 when filled)\n• Same border, focus, error, and disabled styling tokens\n• Same typography (typo-primary-base-regular for values, typo-primary-xs-semibold for floating labels)\n• Same spacing tokens for padding (x:17), gap ($spacing-3xs), and radius ($radius-3xs)\n• Calendar icon uses $colors-icons-meta token styling (16×16, lucide calendar)\n• Popover uses $colors-background-surface, $colors-borders-dark, $shadow-md-* tokens (outer shadow), z-index $z-popover (200), and $spacing-xs padding\n• Popover transition: open = $duration-base + $easing-enter; close = $duration-base + $easing-exit",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Z2Ap4",
                  "name": "Accessibility",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Accessibility\nDatePicker should expose an accessible label via the floating label or an aria-label. Keyboard input must be supported for typing dates directly. The calendar button opens the popover for visual date selection. Validation errors should be announced through field error association (aria-describedby). Popover and calendar behavior should follow React Aria accessibility patterns for focus management, keyboard navigation, and screen reader announcements.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "nakPD",
          "name": "demoTitle",
          "fill": "$sem-text-header",
          "content": "DatePicker demos",
          "lineHeight": "$line-height-lg",
          "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
