                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "Container (frame, vertical layout) + ttHeader (text, xs-semibold, $colors-text-meta) + ttValueRow (frame, horizontal) containing ttMarker (ellipse, 10px), ttLabel (text, xs-regular), ttValue (MoneyText instance, xs-semibold override). Optional ttDivider (rectangle, 1px) and ttTotalRow for with-total variant. The ttTotalValue in with-total uses MoneyText/positive for excess return values."
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "PDd2K",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "H9ao5i",
                  "descendants": {
                    "nZEDL": {
                      "content": "Token usage",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "pn0yx",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "Fill: $colors-background-surface. Stroke: $colors-borders-light, 1px inside. Radius: $radius-2xs. Shadow: $shadow-lg-y, $shadow-lg-blur, $shadow-lg-color. Header text: $typo-primary-xs-semibold, $colors-text-meta. Labels: $typo-primary-xs-regular, $colors-text-body. Values: MoneyText/default instance with xs-semibold font override ($colors-text-header inherited). Markers: single-series uses $chart-sequential/seq-500; multi-series uses $chart-categorical/color-01 through color-03 in order. Total value: MoneyText/positive instance ($colors-text-deposit). Compact variant: MoneyText/default instance with 2xs-semibold font override."
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "HfL3v",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "H9ao5i",
                  "descendants": {
                    "nZEDL": {
                      "content": "Resize behavior",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "VFwhf",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "Single-series and compact use auto width (fit_content). Multi-series and with-total use fixed width for value column alignment. Tooltip does not resize with the chart — it remains anchored near the selected point. Long labels may truncate."
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "EvIM5",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "H9ao5i",
                  "descendants": {
                    "nZEDL": {
                      "content": "Accessibility",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "npRY1",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "Tooltip values should be available through keyboard/focus interaction in implementation. Markers use chart color tokens mapped to series names in the legend. Do not rely on color alone to communicate meaning. Text meets WCAG 2.1 contrast: $colors-text-header on $colors-background-surface provides >4.5:1."
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "hETbA",
