            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "l3tk4t",
              "name": "InteractiveLegend Documentation",
              "width": 640,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 32,
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "x1G4Y",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "H9ao5i",
                  "descendants": {
                    "nZEDL": {
                      "content": "InteractiveLegend",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-lg",
                      "fontWeight": "700",
                      "lineHeight": 1.3333
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "KbJOV",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "A toggleable chart legend molecule that shows active, inactive, and disabled series states. Each item pairs a categorical color marker with a series label and a MoneyText value. Designed to sit alongside or inside chart organisms."
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "rgQBI",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "H9ao5i",
                  "descendants": {
                    "nZEDL": {
                      "content": "When to use",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "bjlYb",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "Use alongside any multi-series chart (area, bar, donut) where users can toggle series visibility. Use active to highlight a selected series. Use inactive to show toggled-off series. Use disabled when a series cannot be toggled. Use compact in dense dashboards or narrow sidebars."
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "Q1RECz",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "H9ao5i",
                  "descendants": {
                    "nZEDL": {
                      "content": "When not to use",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "Bj5ve",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "Single-series charts where a legend is unnecessary. Static legends with no toggle behavior — use ChartLegend instead. Legends without monetary values — use ChartLegend."
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "THVJL",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "H9ao5i",
                  "descendants": {
                    "nZEDL": {
                      "content": "Variants",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "n4HA8V",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "default: All items at full visibility with color markers, labels, and MoneyText/sm values.\nactive: First item emphasized (semibold label, full opacity), remaining items dimmed (0.4 opacity, meta text).\ninactive: Items 2–3 toggled off with strikethrough labels, muted markers (0.3 opacity), meta-colored values. Items 1 and 4 remain active.\ndisabled: Item 4 uses $colors-text-disabled on label and value, marker at 0.2 opacity.\ncompact: 220px width, $spacing-3xs gap, 6px markers, xs typography."
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "HqnnP",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "H9ao5i",
                  "descendants": {
                    "nZEDL": {
                      "content": "Composition",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "KGUss",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "Container (frame, vertical, gap $spacing-xs) → ilItem rows (frame, horizontal, justifyContent space_between, alignItems center) → ilLeft group (ellipse marker + text label) + MoneyText/sm instance. Each row spans full container width. Markers use $chart-categorical/color-01 through color-04."
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "pJ8P1",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "H9ao5i",
                  "descendants": {
                    "nZEDL": {
                      "content": "Token usage",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "RXoVa",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "Markers: $chart-categorical/color-01 through color-04 in series order. Labels: $typo-primary-sm-regular, $colors-text-body (active), $colors-text-meta (inactive), $colors-text-disabled (disabled). Values: MoneyText/sm component, $colors-text-header (active), $colors-text-meta (inactive), $colors-text-disabled (disabled). Compact: $typo-primary-xs-regular labels, $typo-primary-xs-semibold values, 6px markers."
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "JcJ1K",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "H9ao5i",
                  "descendants": {
                    "nZEDL": {
                      "content": "Resize behavior",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "q914v2",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "Container width is fixed (280px default, 220px compact). When placed inside a Card or chart organism, override width to fill_container. Item rows stretch to fill container width via fill_container. MoneyText values right-align naturally via space_between justification."
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "yz6B0",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "H9ao5i",
                  "descendants": {
                    "nZEDL": {
                      "content": "Accessibility",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "FlbDx",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "Each series has both a color marker and a text label — never relies on color alone. Inactive items use strikethrough for additional visual cue beyond color change. Disabled items use $colors-text-disabled which meets WCAG requirements for disabled state indication. Marker colors maintain 3:1 non-text contrast against the surface background."
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "D6M252",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "H9ao5i",
                  "descendants": {
                    "nZEDL": {
                      "content": "Implementation note",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "MJ1h1",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "This component represents visual states. Toggle behavior, hover highlighting, series visibility binding, and keyboard interaction are implementation concerns."
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
