                {
                  "id": "XLoqt",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "Sparkline = sparklineHeader (horizontal: sparkLabel text + DataValueIndicator ref) + sparkValue (MoneyText ref, left-aligned) + sparklineArea (frame, vertical, clip:true). SparklineArea contains sparklineLine (path, stroke only, fill_container) as the flex child for responsive scaling, and endpointDot (ellipse, absolutely positioned at the line endpoint). With-value variant uses MoneyText/lg in a horizontal valueRow with the DataValueIndicator."
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "UJjwt",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "H9ao5i",
                  "descendants": {
                    "nZEDL": {
                      "content": "Token usage",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "hcalJ",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "Positive line: $colors-text-deposit, 1.5px stroke. Negative line: $colors-text-error, 1.5px stroke. Neutral line: $colors-text-meta, 1.5px stroke. Endpoint dot: same color as line, 6px (5px compact). Label: $typo-primary-xs-regular, $colors-text-meta. Value: MoneyText variant (positive/negative/muted). Change: DataValueIndicator variant. With-value label: $typo-primary-sm-regular. Compact label: $typo-primary-2xs-regular. Gap: $spacing-2xs (default), $spacing-xs (with-value), $spacing-3xs (compact)."
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "OhPTY",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "H9ao5i",
                  "descendants": {
                    "nZEDL": {
                      "content": "Resize behavior",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "xmupt",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "Sparkline area uses fill_container width. The path is the flex child of the clipped sparklineArea, so it scales with the parent width via viewBox mapping. The endpoint dot is absolutely positioned at the path endpoint for the default component width. Label row uses space_between to keep label and change indicator at opposite edges. Value stays left-aligned."
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "Dml7R",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "H9ao5i",
                  "descendants": {
                    "nZEDL": {
                      "content": "Accessibility",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "kaPTH",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "Sparkline colors meet WCAG 2.1 non-text contrast (≥3:1). Green ($colors-text-deposit) on white: ~5:1. Red ($colors-text-error) on white: ~5.6:1. Gray ($colors-text-meta) on white: ~4.5:1. Trend direction is communicated by both color and line direction (visual shape), plus the DataValueIndicator symbol (▲/▼/−). Values are always labeled with text — the line alone does not convey meaning."
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "CGXAR",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "H9ao5i",
                  "descendants": {
                    "nZEDL": {
