                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "jgfMT",
                  "name": "AccountRow Documentation",
                  "width": 640,
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 32,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "wIh2u",
                      "name": "Docs Title",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-header",
                      "content": "Account Row",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-xl",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-xl",
                      "fontWeight": "700"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "ilqfB",
                      "name": "Docs Subtitle",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-meta",
                      "content": "Generic Molecule",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "KRZA2",
                      "name": "Purpose",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Purpose\nGeneric content row component for building list items and feed entries. Provides a standard layout with a media slot (32px), multi-line text content area (title + chevron, subtitle, caption), and a right-aligned value display.\n\nUse this as the foundation for specific list item types — override media, title, subtitle, caption, and value via instance descendants.",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "kSBoq",
                      "name": "When to use",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "When to use\n• List items with media thumbnail, title, and supplementary info\n• Feed entries and activity rows\n• Settings rows with values\n• Any row that needs icon/image + text stack + right-aligned content",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "YJPYr",
                      "name": "When not to use",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "When NOT to use\n• Simple text-only lists — use ListRow\n• Card-based layouts — use Card\n• Table rows — use table-specific components\n• Navigation menus — use dedicated nav components",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "W621q",
                      "name": "Variants",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Variants\n• default (OowGc) — transparent background, $radius-2xs corner radius.\n• hover — fill $taupe-100, $radius-xs. Ref to default with fill override.\n• pressed — fill $taupe-200, $radius-xs. Ref to default with fill override.\n• error — caption slot replaced with error status row: icon, status text, and action button.",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "ghhJZ",
                      "name": "Composition",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Composition\nContentRow = row container + Image atom ref (32×32, $radius-2xs) for media + text stack + chevron + MoneyText/sm value.\n• media — nested Image atom ref, 32×32 with $radius-2xs.\n• content — vertical stack (gap $spacing-4xs): titleRow (title text + chevron-right 14px), subtitle, caption\n• value — MoneyText/sm ref, right-aligned\n• error variant — caption slot replaced with status frame: error icon + status text + Button/outline action.",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "FSRWl",
                      "name": "Token usage",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Token usage\n• Media: Image atom at 32×32, $radius-2xs\n• Title: $colors-text-header, $typo-primary-sm-semibold\n• Subtitle/Caption: $colors-text-meta, $typo-primary-xs-regular / $typo-primary-sm-regular\n• Value: $colors-text-header, $typo-primary-sm-semibold (via MoneyText/sm)\n• Padding/gap: $spacing-sm row padding, $spacing-4xs content stack\n• Hover: $taupe-100 + $radius-xs\n• Pressed: $taupe-200 + $radius-xs",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "h3vBcQ",
                      "name": "Accessibility",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Accessibility\n• Entire row is a single interactive target (button or link)\n• Chevron indicates navigability\n• Value should be exposed to screen readers with appropriate context\n• Media should have accessible alt text\n• State is not conveyed by color alone — pressed/hover also change background area",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "eaO2S",
                      "name": "Resize behavior",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Resize behavior\n• Width: fill_container in lists; fixed 640px in library\n• Content stack grows; long titles wrap within info column\n• Value stays right-aligned, does not shrink below content\n• Media fixed 32×32",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "qwxNK",
                      "name": "Logo fallback",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Usage notes\nThis is a generic molecule. To create a specific list item type:\n1. Create a ref to component/ContentRow\n2. Override title, subtitle, caption with specific content\n3. Override media slot with specific image or fallback\n4. Override value with specific data\n5. For error/status states, ref the error variant and override status text and action label.",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
