                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "xQt7V",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Variants\n• default — no fill, bottom border $gray-100\n• hover — $taupe-100, $radius-xs\n• pressed — $taupe-200, $radius-xs\n• pending — PENDING Tag + orange amount ($orange-600)\n• TransactionTableHeader — taupe header bar with sort icons",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "ZoPqZ",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Composition\n• dateStack — month (2xs) + day (md semibold), fixed 44px\n• descCell — 32px avatar (Image ref) + description text, fill_container\n• category — sm regular meta text, fixed 130px\n• account — sm regular meta text, fixed 140px\n• amount — MoneyText ref, fixed 100px",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
