            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "QWKZg",
              "name": "DetailRow Documentation",
              "width": 640,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 32,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "HYjTq",
                  "name": "Title",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-header",
                  "content": "DetailRow",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-xl",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-xl",
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "TVjmX",
                  "name": "Subtitle",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-meta",
                  "content": "PFM Molecule",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "wzEZ5",
                  "name": "Purpose",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Purpose\nDense label/value row for detail drawer sections. Displays a fixed-width label column (140px) on the left and a value on the right, with a 16px gap. Two layout patterns: 2-column (label + value) for standard key-value pairs, and 3-column (date + description + amount) for transaction rows. Used exclusively inside DetailSection groups within AccountDetailDrawer, TransactionDetailDrawer, and HoldingDetailDrawer.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "pDvIA",
                  "name": "When to use",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When to use\n• Label/value pairs inside drawer detail sections (Account Details, Balances, Transaction Details, Holding Details, Performance, Classification, etc.)\n• Monetary values (use money/positive/negative variants)\n• Empty/null values (use muted variant with — dash)\n• Transaction rows in Recent Activity sections (use transaction-negative/transaction-positive variants with 3-column date/description/amount layout)",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "isPZd",
                  "name": "When not to use",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When NOT to use\n• Interactive navigation rows — use ListRow instead\n• Table rows — use TableRow/HoldingsTableRow/ActivityTransactionRow\n• Card summaries — use Card, KpiCard, or CardHeader\n• Standalone inline content — DetailRow is designed for grouped sections",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "K7Z6t",
                  "name": "Variants",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Variants\n• default — text label, text value (2-column: label + value)\n• /money — text label, MoneyText ref value (default monetary)\n• /positive — text label, MoneyText/positive ref (green, for gains/deposits)\n• /negative — text label, MoneyText/negative ref (red, for losses/debits)\n• /muted — text label, muted dash value (— for empty/null fields)\n• /transaction-negative — 3-column: date text, description text (fill), negative MoneyText amount\n• /transaction-positive — 3-column: date text, description text (fill), positive MoneyText amount",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Fjd1i",
                  "name": "Composition",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Composition\n• Frame: horizontal, justifyContent start, center-aligned vertically, height 52, padding $spacing-sm\n• 2-column variants (default, money, positive, negative, muted): gap 16\n  — Label: text, $colors-text-meta, $typo-primary-sm-regular, textGrowth fixed-width, width 140\n  — Value: text ($colors-text-body) or MoneyText ref (variant-dependent)\n• 3-column transaction variants (transaction-negative, transaction-positive): gap 12\n  — Date: text, $colors-text-meta, $typo-primary-sm-regular, textGrowth fixed-width, width 140\n  — Description: frame with fill_container containing $colors-text-body text\n  — Amount: MoneyText ref (negative or positive)\n• Width: 400 default; fill_container when used inside section rows\n• Bottom border: built-in 1px $colors-borders-light stroke (strokeAlignment inner, strokeWidth bottom only)",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "V1nlk",
                  "name": "Accessibility",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Accessibility\n• Label and value are visually separated by a consistent 140px label column, aiding scannability\n• MoneyText variants inherit accessible color contrast from token definitions\n• Muted variant's — dash should have aria-label indicating empty/not applicable\n• Transaction variants separate date, description, and amount into distinct columns for clear parsing\n\nImplementation note\nPercentages and mixed gain/loss strings (e.g. +26.91%, +$1,220.00 (+2.14%)) should use the default text-value variant with color overrides, not MoneyText variants. MoneyText is for standalone dollar amounts only.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
