            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "V5cjI2",
              "name": "FollowUpBlock Documentation",
              "width": 640,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 32,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "kOU01",
                  "name": "Docs Title",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-header",
                  "content": "FollowUpBlock",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-xl",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-xl",
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ZPrhK",
                  "name": "Docs Subtitle",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-meta",
                  "content": "Chat Follow-Up Organism",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "g9xNJD",
                  "name": "Purpose",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Purpose\nA chat-oriented follow-up suggestions block for generated UI responses. FollowUpBlock surfaces suggested next actions or questions the user can take after reading a response. It composes Card (surface), CardHeader (title/description), optional TextContent (body copy), and Button (actions) into a single cohesive organism. Content is arranged with vertical flex-layout frames — no Stack component refs or hidden placeholder layers.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "HJttC",
                  "name": "When to use",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When to use\n• Suggested next questions after a generated response\n• Follow-up actions in chat or immutable feed\n• Quick prompts that guide the user to continue exploration\n• Short action lists related to the current response\n• Assistant-driven suggestion blocks in conversational UI",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "YaQMe",
                  "name": "When not to use",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When NOT to use\n• Primary form submission actions (use Button directly)\n• Navigation tabs (use TabsGroup)\n• Long menus or large option lists (use Select or Accordion)\n• Multi-select choices (use Checkbox group)\n• Persistent page-level navigation (use Nav or Sidebar)",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "V4bbmK",
                  "name": "Variants",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Variants / Defaults\n• layout: vertical | horizontal  →  vertical\n• itemCount: 2 | 3 | 4  →  3\n• density: default | compact  →  default\n• buttonVariant: outline | text  →  outline\n• bodyText: false | true  →  false\n• width: hug | fill  →  fill\n\nDefault variant uses Card with $spacing-md padding, CardHeader/description for title (18 px) + subtitle (16 px, text-meta), and a vertical button stack of 3 outline Buttons that fill the available width.\n\nWith-body-text variant adds a visible TextContent block (14 px, text-body) between header and buttons for helper copy — this is a proper component variant (FollowUpBlock/with-body-text), not a hidden toggle.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "U8BM9E",
                  "name": "Composition map",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Composition map\n• FollowUpBlock = Card + CardHeader + optional TextContent + Button\n• Card provides the outer surface (background, border, radius, padding)\n• CardHeader/description provides title and optional description\n• CardHeader (title-only) is used for compact density\n• TextContent provides optional body/helper copy between header and actions\n• Content frame arranges header, optional body text, and button stack vertically\n• Button stack frame controls button direction (vertical or horizontal) and spacing\n• Button/outline provides the default follow-up action\n• Button/text provides the text-only follow-up action (optional variant)\n• Card/dense is used for compact density (smaller padding)\n• No hidden placeholder layers — all internal nodes are visible and active",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "eeSFK",
                  "name": "Token usage",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Token usage\n\nSurface\n• Card background = $colors-background-surface\n• Card border = $colors-borders-light (1 px, inside)\n• Card radius = $radius-xs (12 px)\n• Card padding default = $spacing-md (24 px)\n• Card padding compact = $spacing-sm (16 px, via Card/dense)\n• Card shadow = none\n\nSpacing\n• Content gap (header → body text → buttons) = $spacing-sm (16 px)\n• CardHeader internal gap (title ↔ description) = $spacing-3xs (4 px)\n• Button Stack gap between buttons = $spacing-xs (12 px)\n\nTitle\n• Typography = $typo-primary-md-semibold-* (18 px, weight 600)\n• Color = $colors-text-header\n\nDescription / subtitle\n• Typography = $typo-primary-base-regular-* (16 px, weight normal)\n• Color = $colors-text-meta\n\nOptional body / helper text\n• Typography = $typo-primary-sm-regular-* (14 px, weight normal)\n• Color = $colors-text-body\n• Appears between description and buttons in with-body-text variant\n\nButton / outline\n• Background = transparent (no fill)\n• Border = $colors-btnSecondaryBorder (1 px, inside)\n• Text = $colors-btnSecondaryText\n• Typography = $typo-primary-base-* (16 px, weight 500)\n• Radius = $radius-full (pill)\n• Padding = $spacing-xs / $spacing-md (12 / 24 px)\n\nButton / text (optional variant)\n• Text = $blue-600\n• No fill, no border\n• Padding = $spacing-xs / 0\n\nMotion\n• No motion or transition tokens are applied at the FollowUpBlock level. Button transitions are inherited from the Button component.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "w8Ooc",
                  "name": "Resize behavior",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Resize behavior\n• Outer wrapper frame accepts fill_container to stretch with parent\n• Card fills the wrapper width via fill_container\n• CardHeader fills Card content area via fill_container\n• Optional body/helper text fills Card content area via fill_container\n• Button Stack fills Card content area via fill_container\n• In vertical layout, each Button fills the Stack width via fill_container\n• In horizontal layout, Buttons hug their content and sit in a row\n• Hug variant uses fit_content on the wrapper; Card keeps its default 320 px width\n• No overflow when compressed — all internal layers stretch/shrink with the parent\n• No detached, fixed-width, or floating internal layers",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Rl8kF",
                  "name": "Accessibility",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Accessibility\nFollowUpBlock should expose a clear section label via role=\"region\" and aria-label or aria-labelledby referencing the CardHeader title. Button labels must be descriptive and keyboard accessible. If buttons trigger chat prompts or assistant actions, implementation should expose the correct action semantics (e.g., aria-label describing the action). Focus order should follow visual order: title, description, optional body text, then buttons top-to-bottom (or left-to-right in horizontal layout).",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
