                  "name": "component/ListBlock",
                  "context": "ListBlock displays structured lists inside a Card. Informational rows use ListRow/no-chevron variants (no-chevron-border for separated rows, no-chevron for the last row). Interactive rows use ListRow chevron variants (with-border for separated rows, default for the last row). Checklist rows use Checkbox instances. Radio rows use Radio instances. Tag rows use Tag instances. Does not use custom row structures or manual separator lines.",
