            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "U7bwvi",
              "name": "ListBlock Documentation",
              "width": 640,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 32,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "H9cdg",
                  "name": "Docs Title",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-header",
                  "content": "ListBlock",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-xl",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-xl",
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Pbxw2",
                  "name": "Docs Subtitle",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-meta",
                  "content": "Chat Structured List Organism",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "JchzR",
                  "name": "Purpose",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Purpose\nA chat-oriented structured list block for generated UI responses. ListBlock surfaces grouped items — recommendations, insights, checklist tasks, radio selections, or categorized facts — inside a Card surface with a titled header. It composes Card (surface), CardHeader (title/description), ListRow no-chevron variants (informational rows: no-chevron, no-chevron-border, no-chevron-description, no-chevron-description-border), Checkbox (checklist rows), Radio (selection rows), Tag (topic rows), and ListRow chevron variants (interactive clickable rows) into a reusable organism. No hidden placeholder layers.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "a48yO",
                  "name": "When to use",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When to use\n• Structured generated response lists\n• Recommendations and next steps\n• Key insights and summaries\n• Account or transaction summaries\n• Checklists and task-style lists\n• Radio selection lists (single-choice from options)\n• Ranked or numbered items\n• Groups of related facts or categories\n• Tag-based topic lists",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Yn4wr",
                  "name": "When not to use",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When NOT to use\n• Freeform prose paragraphs — use TextContent\n• Follow-up suggestions — use FollowUpBlock\n• Collapsible grouped content — use Accordion\n• Large data tables — use DataTable\n• Navigation menus — use Nav components\n• Multi-select controls — use Checkbox/Tag patterns directly",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "XFZJy",
                  "name": "Variants",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Variants / Defaults\n• rowType: simple | numbered | checklist | tag | interactive | radio-list  →  simple\n• itemCount: 3 | 4  →  4\n• density: default | compact  →  default\n• description: true | false  →  true\n• width: fill  →  fill\n\nDefault variant uses Card with $spacing-md padding, CardHeader/description for title (18 px) + subtitle (16 px, text-meta), and a vertical list of ListRow/no-chevron-border refs (rows 1–3) plus a final ListRow/no-chevron ref (last row, no bottom separator).\n\nCompact variant uses Card/dense with $spacing-sm padding, CardHeader (title-only), ListRow/no-chevron-border refs (rows 1–2) plus a final ListRow/no-chevron ref.\n\nNumbered variant embeds index markers in the ListRow title text (e.g. \"1. Review your account allocation\"). Uses ListRow/no-chevron-border refs for rows 1–3, ListRow/no-chevron for the last row.\n\nChecklist variant uses real Checkbox and Checkbox/checked component instances for task-style lists.\n\nWith-tags variant uses real Tag component instances arranged in horizontal rows.\n\nInteractive variant uses real ListRow default instances (with chevron) for clickable rows with $spacing-2xs gap between rows.\n\nRadio-list variant uses real Radio and Radio/checked component instances for single-selection lists.\n\nLong-content variant uses ListRow/no-chevron-description-border refs (rows 1–2) plus ListRow/no-chevron-description (last row). Title provides a short summary; description provides the full detail text. Both title and description wrap cleanly.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "UDV8f",
                  "name": "Composition map",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Composition map\n• ListBlock = Card + CardHeader + row content (ListRow refs, Checkbox, Radio, or Tag)\n• Card provides the outer surface (background, border, radius, padding)\n• CardHeader/description provides title and optional description\n• CardHeader (title-only) is used for compact density\n• Content frame arranges header and list items vertically\n• Informational rows use ListRow no-chevron variants:\n  – ListRow/no-chevron-border for rows with bottom separator\n  – ListRow/no-chevron for the last row (no trailing separator)\n  – ListRow/no-chevron-description-border for long-content rows with separator\n  – ListRow/no-chevron-description for the last long-content row\n• ListRow border variants include a built-in Separator — no separate Separator refs needed\n• Interactive rows use ListRow default (with chevron)\n• Numbered rows embed the index in the ListRow title text (e.g. \"1. Item text\")\n• Checkbox / Checkbox/checked components are used for checklist rows\n• Radio / Radio/checked components are used for radio-list rows\n• Tag components are used for tag-style list items in horizontal wrap rows\n• Card/dense is used for compact density (smaller padding)\n• No hidden placeholder layers — all internal nodes are visible and active",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "F8Q8d",
                  "name": "Token usage",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Token usage\n\nSurface\n• Card background = $colors-background-surface\n• Card border = $colors-borders-light (1 px, inside)\n• Card radius = $radius-xs\n• Card padding default = $spacing-md\n• Card padding compact = $spacing-sm (via Card/dense)\n\nSpacing\n• Content gap (header → list) = $spacing-sm\n• Content gap compact = $spacing-xs\n• CardHeader internal gap = $spacing-3xs\n• List items gap = 0 (separators built into ListRow border variants)\n• Interactive row gap = 0 (border variants provide built-in separation)\n• Tag grid gap = $spacing-2xs\n• Checklist item gap = $spacing-2xs\n• Radio item gap = $spacing-2xs\n\nInformational rows (ListRow no-chevron variants)\n• One-line row height = 40px (inherited from ListRow)\n• Row vertical padding = $spacing-2xs (8px top, 8px bottom)\n• No horizontal padding\n• Title = $typo-primary-sm-regular-*, $colors-text-body\n• Description (long-content variant) = $typo-primary-xs-regular-*, $colors-text-meta\n• Text Stack gap (title ↔ description) = $spacing-3xs\n• Border variant includes Separator at bottom ($colors-borders-light, 1 px)\n• No background fill, no chevron icon, no reserved chevron space\n\nCardHeader title\n• Typography = $typo-primary-md-semibold-* (18 px, weight 600)\n• Color = $colors-text-header (inherited from Label)\n\nCardHeader description / subtitle\n• Typography = $typo-primary-base-regular-* (16 px, weight normal)\n• Color = $colors-text-meta\n\nNumbered marker\n• Embedded in ListRow title text (e.g. \"1. Item\")\n• Uses ListRow no-chevron tokens ($colors-text-body)\n\nInteractive row (ListRow with chevron)\n• One-line row height = 40px (inherited from ListRow)\n• Row vertical padding = $spacing-2xs (8px top, 8px bottom)\n• No horizontal padding\n• Row gap (text ↔ chevron) = $spacing-xs\n• Title = $typo-primary-sm-regular-*, $colors-text-body\n• Chevron = lucide chevron-right, $colors-text-meta, 16 × 16\n• Hover = title and chevron shift to $colors-text-header\n\nChecklist rows\n• Uses Checkbox / Checkbox/checked component tokens\n\nRadio rows\n• Uses Radio / Radio/checked component tokens\n\nTag items\n• Uses Tag component tokens\n\nMotion\n• No motion tokens applied at the ListBlock level. Child component transitions are inherited.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "dGAOn",
                  "name": "Resize behavior",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Resize behavior\n• Outer wrapper frame accepts fill_container to stretch with parent\n• Card fills the wrapper width via fill_container\n• CardHeader fills Card content area via fill_container\n• List items frame fills Card content area via fill_container\n• ListRow refs (all variants) fill list width via fill_container\n• ListRow title text uses textGrowth: fixed-width + fill_container for wrapping\n• ListRow description text (long-content) uses textGrowth: fixed-width + fill_container for wrapping\n• No-chevron rows do not reserve trailing icon space — text fills the full row width\n• Tag rows use horizontal layout; tags hug their content\n• ListRow (interactive) instances fill width via fill_container; chevron stays right-aligned\n• Numbered rows embed index in title text — single text node wraps naturally\n• Checkbox and Radio rows keep controls aligned via component layout\n• No overflow when compressed — all internal layers stretch/shrink\n• No detached, fixed-width, floating, or hidden internal layers",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "aTu0H",
                  "name": "Accessibility",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Accessibility\nListBlock should expose a clear section label via role=\"region\" and aria-labelledby referencing the CardHeader title. Informational lists use ListRow no-chevron refs and should use semantic list elements (ul/ol). Long-content rows use ListRow/no-chevron-description with title and description — both should be accessible in reading order. Numbered lists should use ordered list semantics with index embedded in the title text. Checklist rows with Checkbox must expose checked state and be keyboard accessible. Radio rows must expose selected state and be keyboard accessible. Interactive rows use ListRow (with chevron) and should be keyboard accessible with button semantics and descriptive labels. Focus order follows visual order: title, description, then list items top-to-bottom.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
