            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "i8uybn",
              "name": "ImageGallery Documentation",
              "width": 640,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 32,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "xPoJx",
                  "name": "Docs Title",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-header",
                  "content": "ImageGallery",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-xl",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-xl",
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "cK9a5",
                  "name": "Docs Subtitle",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-meta",
                  "content": "Image Grid / Gallery Organism",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "NAyn9",
                  "name": "Purpose",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Purpose\nA responsive image gallery organism for generated UI responses and static content pages. ImageGallery displays multiple images in a clean grid layout using existing Hemlock components. It composes Image (bare display), ImageBlock (image + caption/credit), Card (optional outer surface), and CardHeader (optional title/description) into a flexible gallery organism. Content is arranged with horizontal row frames inside a vertical container — no hidden placeholder layers.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "zqEvG",
                  "name": "When to use",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When to use\n• Groups of related images\n• Generated visual examples\n• Image collections in articles or reports\n• Content sections with multiple media items\n• Image sets with optional captions\n• Before/after examples\n• Product or content image collections\n• Grouped image references",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "WM3C6",
                  "name": "When not to use",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When NOT to use\n• A single image — use ImageBlock\n• Carousel/slideshow behavior — use Carousel if/when created\n• Full-screen image viewing — use a dedicated lightbox/modal pattern later\n• Data visualization — use chart components\n• Image upload flows — use a dedicated upload pattern",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "gAV2Q",
                  "name": "Variants",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Variants / Defaults\n• columns: 2 | 3  →  2 (2×2 grid)\n• captions: true | false  →  false\n• header: true | false  →  false\n• outerSurface: true | false  →  false\n• density: default | compact  →  default\n• width: fill  →  fill\n\nDefault variant (image-only-grid) uses a 2×2 grid of Image refs with $spacing-sm gap. No Card surface, no captions.\n\nWith-captions variant uses ImageBlock refs (image + caption) arranged in a single row of 3. Captions inherit ImageBlock styling ($typo-primary-sm-regular-*, $colors-text-body).\n\nTwo-column variant uses 2 larger Image refs (height 220px) side by side.\n\nThree-column variant uses 3 Image refs in a single row.\n\nMixed-aspect-ratio variant demonstrates different image heights per row: row 1 has 2 tall images (240px), row 2 has 3 shorter images (140px).\n\nWith-header variant wraps the grid in a Card surface with CardHeader/description for title and subtitle. Uses Card tokens for surface styling.\n\nCompact variant uses $spacing-2xs gap instead of $spacing-sm for a denser layout.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "L1TRQ",
                  "name": "Composition map",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Composition map\n• ImageGallery = row frames + Image/ImageBlock refs\n• Row frames (horizontal layout) arrange images side by side\n• Grid frame (vertical layout) stacks rows\n• Image ref provides bare image display (clip, radius, fill mode)\n• ImageBlock ref provides image + caption (and optional credit)\n• Card ref provides optional outer surface (with-header variant)\n• CardHeader/description ref provides title and subtitle (with-header variant)\n• Image refs use fill_container width to distribute evenly in each row\n• No Stack component refs — rows are plain flex frames\n• No hidden placeholder layers — all internal nodes are visible and active",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "k2cMI1",
                  "name": "Token usage",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Token usage\n\nGrid spacing\n• Row gap (between rows) = $spacing-sm (16 px)\n• Column gap (between images in a row) = $spacing-sm (16 px)\n• Compact gap = $spacing-2xs (8 px)\n\nImage\n• Corner radius = $radius-xs (inherited from Image component)\n• Default height = 180 px (inherited from Image component)\n• Fill mode = fill (image covers the frame)\n• Clip = true (inherited from Image component)\n\nCaption (with-captions variant)\n• Typography = $typo-primary-sm-regular-* (14 px, weight normal)\n• Color = $colors-text-body (inherited from TextContent via ImageBlock)\n• Gap (image → caption) = $spacing-2xs (inherited from ImageBlock)\n\nCard surface (with-header variant)\n• Background = $colors-background-surface\n• Border = $colors-borders-light (1 px, inside)\n• Radius = $radius-xs\n• Padding = $spacing-md\n• Content gap = $spacing-sm\n\nCardHeader (with-header variant)\n• Title = $typo-primary-md-semibold-* (18 px, weight 600), $colors-text-header\n• Description = $typo-primary-base-regular-* (16 px), $colors-text-meta\n• Internal gap = $spacing-2xs\n\nMotion\n• No motion tokens applied at the ImageGallery level. Child component transitions are inherited.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "e6Ge7R",
                  "name": "Resize behavior",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Resize behavior\n• Outer gallery frame accepts width override to stretch with parent\n• Row frames fill available width via fill_container\n• Image refs fill row width via fill_container, distributing evenly\n• Image height remains fixed (proportional stretching is width-only)\n• ImageBlock refs fill row width; captions wrap inside their image blocks\n• Card ref (with-header) fills outer frame width via fill_container\n• CardHeader fills Card content area via fill_container\n• No overflow when compressed — all internal layers stretch/shrink\n• No detached, fixed-width, floating, or hidden internal layers",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "q3Zo0",
                  "name": "Accessibility",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Accessibility\nImageGallery should preserve accessible image descriptions. Each image should have appropriate alt text in implementation. Captions and alt text are not the same: alt text describes the image for assistive technologies, caption provides visible context. Decorative images may use empty alt text. Preserve logical reading order (left-to-right, top-to-bottom). If images become clickable later (e.g. lightbox), each interactive image must have a descriptive label and keyboard support.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "BAcGI",
                  "name": "Implementation note",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Implementation note\nThis version covers the gallery/grid layout only. Lightbox behavior is out of scope and should be handled by a dedicated modal/lightbox pattern if needed later. The grid uses manual row frames rather than CSS grid or flex-wrap, since the .pen layout system is single-axis only. For different column counts, use the appropriate variant (two-column, three-column) or create rows with the desired number of Image refs.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "iUd5G",
          "name": "ImageGallery Demo Examples Title",
          "fill": "$sem-text-header",
          "content": "ImageGallery — Demo Examples",
          "lineHeight": "$line-height-xl",
