                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "name": "When Not",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "Avoid Carousel for large datasets (use a grid or list instead), single-image displays (use Image or ImageBlock), or content that must all be visible simultaneously. Do not use for auto-advancing promotional banners without a pausable mechanism."
