                },
                {
                  "id": "J5jIY",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "H9ao5i",
                  "name": "Composition Title",
                  "descendants": {
                    "nZEDL": {
                      "content": "Composition",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "s1K0n",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "name": "Composition",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "Carousel = viewport + Image/ImageBlock slide content + edge-aligned Button/secondary controls + PaginationDot indicators.\n\nControls sit on the left and right edges of the viewport, vertically centered, with the button center aligned to the viewport edge — each button appears half inside and half outside the slide area. Controls use Button/secondary/icon-left (prev) and Button/secondary/icon-right (next) at 32×32 with label disabled for icon-only appearance. Control overrides: $colors-background-surface fill (white), no stroke, shadow-lg effect, $radius-full. Controls use layoutPosition:absolute and do not push slide content inward. Disabled states use opacity:0.4 on the affected control. Image slides use Image (default) or ImageBlock (image-with-caption). Multi-card slides use Card + CardHeader/description + Image. With-header wraps the carousel in Card + CardHeader/description. Navigation is handled by previous/next controls — clickable dots are out of scope. Pagination uses PaginationDot atom below the viewport — active dot uses PaginationDot/active ($blue-500), inactive dots use PaginationDot ($colors-borders-light). Dot row is centered below the viewport."
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "Qa1nY",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "H9ao5i",
                  "name": "Tokens Title",
                  "descendants": {
                    "nZEDL": {
                      "content": "Token usage",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "mkMl0",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "name": "Tokens",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "Spacing: $spacing-sm (carousel gaps), $spacing-3xs (control padding), $spacing-2xs (dot gaps). Radius: $radius-xs (viewport, slide, card images), $radius-sm (multi-card Card corners), $radius-full (controls). Shadow: $shadow-lg-y, $shadow-lg-blur, $shadow-lg-color (control drop shadow). Fill: $colors-background-surface (control background). Icon color: $colors-btnPrimaryInvertedText (inherited from Button/secondary). Colors: $blue-500 (active dot via PaginationDot/active), $colors-borders-light (inactive dot via PaginationDot), $colors-background-surface (Card background via Card component). Controls: 32×32 fixed size, icon-only, no border. Typography: inherited from CardHeader, TextContent, ImageBlock."
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "kyAqc",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "H9ao5i",
                  "name": "Resize Title",
                  "descendants": {
                    "nZEDL": {
                      "content": "Resize behavior",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "t8CpoN",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "name": "Resize",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "Outer container fills available width. Viewport fills available width; slide content (Image/ImageBlock/Card) fills the viewport via flex layout. Controls are positioned on the viewport edges using absolute positioning — the button center aligns with the viewport edge, so each button extends 16px outside the viewport bounds. When the carousel width changes, recalculate the next control x position (viewport width − 16). Controls remain 32×32 and do not stretch. Captions wrap inside the ImageBlock. Dots remain centered below the viewport. No fixed-width inner layers prevent resizing."
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "QYWOd",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "H9ao5i",
                  "name": "A11y Title",
                  "descendants": {
                    "nZEDL": {
                      "content": "Accessibility",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "g2j48r",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "name": "A11y",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "Previous/next controls must be keyboard accessible. Controls need descriptive aria-labels (e.g. \"Previous slide\", \"Next slide\"). Dots should expose current slide state (aria-current). Carousel should not auto-advance by default. If autoplay is added later, it must be pausable. Focus order should follow: prev control → slide content → next control → indicators."
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "QTWvz",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "H9ao5i",
                  "name": "Impl Title",
                  "descendants": {
                    "nZEDL": {
                      "content": "Implementation note",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    }
                  }
