                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "Segments: $chart-categorical/color-01 through color-15, each mapped to an account type. Gaps: 2.5° angular gap between all segments (built into startAngle/sweepAngle values). Default/compact: all segments at opacity:0.35 (muted resting state). Hover/pressed: active segment at full opacity, non-active segments at opacity:0.35. Static-filled/with-legend: all segments at full opacity. Card: $colors-background-surface, $colors-borders-light. Center value: MoneyText/lg. Center label: $typo-primary-xs-regular, $colors-text-meta. Legend: $typo-primary-2xs-regular, $colors-text-body. Tooltip: ChartTooltip with shadow, surface, border tokens."
