                  "descendants": {
                    "nZEDL": {
                      "content": "Resize behavior",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "Uu02W",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "Card fills available width. Donut ring has fixed dimensions (200×200 default, 140×140 compact) and is horizontally centered by alignItems:center. Center text stays centered via absolute positioning. Segment gaps remain consistent at any scale. Tooltip (hover) is absolutely positioned and may need dynamic repositioning in implementation. Legend wraps in 2 columns within the card width."
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "dd2uf",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "H9ao5i",
                  "descendants": {
                    "nZEDL": {
                      "content": "Accessibility",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "lECPJ",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "All 15 chart-categorical colors maintain ≥3:1 contrast as non-text graphical elements against the white card background. Center value (MoneyText) and center label ($colors-text-meta) meet WCAG AA for text contrast. Legend labels use $colors-text-body on $colors-background-surface. Tooltip text uses standard text tokens on surface background. Color is never the sole identifier — the with-legend variant provides text labels for all 15 segments."
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "oAUmH",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "H9ao5i",
                  "descendants": {
                    "nZEDL": {
                      "content": "Implementation note",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "f2DzpT",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "This is a visual chart component. Real segment sizing from data values, animated transitions, hover/tap detection, tooltip positioning, segment pull-out animation, and responsive ring sizing are implementation concerns. The 15 segments shown represent account allocation categories. Angular gaps are built into the start/sweep angle calculations (2.5° between each segment). Hover and pressed states use opacity to de-emphasize non-active segments."
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
