                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "KpiCard = Card ref + kpiContent (frame, vertical, gap:$spacing-xs). Content: kpiLabel (text, xs-semibold, uppercase, $colors-text-meta) + kpiValue (MoneyText ref, xl-semibold, left-aligned) + kpiChange (DataValueIndicator ref). With-sparkline: valueRow (horizontal, value + DVI) + sparklineArea (frame, vertical, clip:true, fill_container, sparkline path + endpoint dot). Neutral uses plain text for the percentage value. Accent uses MoneyText/default with $colors-text-action fill override."
                    }
                  }
                },
