                      "content": "Card: $colors-background-surface, $colors-borders-light, $radius-sm, $spacing-md padding. Label: $typo-primary-xs-semibold, $colors-text-meta. Value: $typo-primary-xl-semibold (compact: base-semibold). Positive: $colors-text-deposit. Negative: $colors-text-error. Neutral: $colors-text-header. Accent: $colors-text-action. Change: DataValueIndicator tokens. Sparkline: $colors-text-deposit stroke, 1.5px."
                    }
                  }
                },
