            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "jC5da",
              "name": "CandlestickChart Documentation",
              "width": 640,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 32,
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "i30gT",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "H9ao5i",
                  "descendants": {
                    "nZEDL": {
                      "content": "CandlestickChart",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-lg",
                      "fontWeight": "700",
                      "lineHeight": 1.3333
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "dnfOU",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "A candlestick chart organism showing OHLC (Open-High-Low-Close) price data. Built on Card with CardHeader, y-axis labels, and a clipped plot area containing candle bodies (rectangles) and wicks (thin rectangles). Green candles indicate price increase, red candles indicate decrease."
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "KGsQu",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "H9ao5i",
                  "descendants": {
                    "nZEDL": {
                      "content": "When to use",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "jf6hb",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "Use for stock/ETF price visualization showing open, high, low, and close over discrete periods. The candlestick format shows both direction and volatility. Use with-grid for denser reference lines. Use compact in dense dashboards. Use no-card when embedding inside another container."
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "WUC4u",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "H9ao5i",
                  "descendants": {
                    "nZEDL": {
                      "content": "When not to use",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "zwSkq",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "Do not use for non-financial data. Do not use when only close prices matter — use a line chart or AreaChart instead. Do not use for very long time periods with many data points — the candles become too narrow."
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "NYhLH",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "H9ao5i",
                  "descendants": {
                    "nZEDL": {
                      "content": "Variants",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "wt66i",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "default: Standard OHLC candlestick chart with 16px body width, 2px wick.\nwith-tooltip: Default with ChartTooltip/with-total positioned near the selected candle. Shows Open, High, Low in value rows with MoneyText. Close and Change (+%) in the total row, using MoneyText/positive for the change value. Markers use the selected candle's bullish/bearish color.\ncompact: 360px width, 140px plot height, 12px body width.\nwith-grid: Adds sub-grid lines between main grid lines at 30% opacity for finer reference.\nno-card: Same chart structure without Card wrapper."
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "Q8VQY",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "H9ao5i",
                  "descendants": {
                    "nZEDL": {
                      "content": "Composition",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "VTklX",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "CandlestickChart = Card + CardHeader/description + chartBody (chartRow: yAxis + plotArea) + xAxis + optional ChartTooltip. PlotArea (layout: none, clip: true) contains grid lines and candle groups. Each candle group is a frame with layout: none containing a wick rectangle (2px wide, centered) and a body rectangle (16px wide). Up candles: $colors-text-deposit. Down candles: $colors-text-error. With-tooltip adds ChartTooltip/with-total (layoutPosition: absolute) inside chartBody showing OHLC values and change percentage for the selected candle."
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "Q0Pz3",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "H9ao5i",
                  "descendants": {
                    "nZEDL": {
                      "content": "Token usage",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "aOtgg",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "Up candle body/wick: $colors-text-deposit (green). Down candle body/wick: $colors-text-error (red). Body width: 16px (default), 12px (compact). Wick width: 2px. Grid: $colors-borders-light. Sub-grid: $colors-borders-light at 30% opacity. Axis: $colors-borders-dark. Labels: $typo-primary-2xs-regular, $colors-text-meta. Tooltip (with-tooltip): ChartTooltip tokens — $colors-background-surface fill, $colors-borders-light stroke, outer shadow. OHLC values use MoneyText; change uses MoneyText/positive (bullish) or MoneyText/negative (bearish)."
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "LqQjl",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "H9ao5i",
                  "descendants": {
                    "nZEDL": {
                      "content": "Resize behavior",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "U2KBVu",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "Card fills available width. Grid lines extend to 5000px and clip. Candle positions are absolute within plot area — positions should be recalculated when container width changes. Y-axis labels stay aligned. X-axis labels distribute via space_between."
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "xqBYU",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "H9ao5i",
                  "descendants": {
                    "nZEDL": {
                      "content": "Accessibility",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "sg5l4",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "Green/red candle colors should not be the sole indicator — provide text summaries. Candle colors meet 3:1 non-text contrast against background. Provide tooltip with OHLC values on interaction. Axis labels remain readable."
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "bU6qG",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "H9ao5i",
                  "descendants": {
                    "nZEDL": {
                      "content": "Implementation note",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "y9E3pn",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "This is a visual chart component. Real OHLC data binding, candle positioning, tooltip with price details, responsive redistribution, and animation are implementation concerns."
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
