                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "AXaf7",
                  "name": "AccountSelector Documentation",
                  "width": 640,
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 32,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "hjARW",
                      "name": "Docs Title",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-header",
                      "content": "Account Selector",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-xl",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-xl",
                      "fontWeight": "700"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "QRHUA",
                      "name": "Docs Subtitle",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-meta",
                      "content": "PFM Global Component (Select-based)",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "ZUVuT",
                      "name": "Purpose",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Purpose\nAccount picker for PFM screens. Built on the Select form control: closed state uses Select (empty-style trigger); open states use Select/open with a custom grouped dropdown (All Accounts, Banking, Credit & Loans, Investments, Add Account actions).",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "MRRGh",
                      "name": "When to use",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "When to use\n• Global account filter in PFM header or toolbar\n• Switching context between all accounts and a single account\n• Portfolio screens that need grouped account lists (banking, credit, investments)",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "fyNyM",
                      "name": "When not to use",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "When NOT to use\n• Simple short lists (fewer than 3 options) — use Radio group or plain Select\n• Multi-select accounts — use Checkbox group\n• Searchable/filterable lists — use Combobox\n• Navigation menus — use Menu or Nav",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "E0BJY",
                      "name": "Variants",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Variants\n• closed — compact trigger showing the selected account value (default: All Accounts) with a chevron-down icon. Built on Select.\n• open — trigger with chevron-up + dropdown menu visible. All Accounts row is highlighted as the current selection ($taupe-200). Built on Select/open with a custom grouped dropdown.\n• open-hover — same as open, with one account row showing a hover highlight ($taupe-100). Example: Wells Fargo Everyday Checking (••1234).",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "OZGmd",
                      "name": "Composition",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Composition\nAccountSelector = Select trigger + chevron + dropdown menu + section groups + account rows + Add Account action.\n• closed: Select (jncEi) ref with content/style overrides.\n• open/open-hover: Select/open (L7J5OM) ref with full dropdown replacement.\n• Dropdown: All Accounts row + Banking section + Credit & Loans section + Investments section.\n• Each section: uppercase header + account rows + Add Account (Button/text icon-right ref).\n• Account numbers use masked format (••XXXX).\n• Do not detach from Select — override descendants only.",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "eTKhQ",
                      "name": "Token usage",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Token usage\n• Trigger bg: $colors-background-surface. Border: $colors-borders-dark. Radius: 8px (override) / $radius-3xs (base).\n• Dropdown surface: $base-white. Border: $colors-borders-dark. Radius: $radius-2xs. Shadow: $shadow-md tokens.\n• Text: $colors-text-header (account names), $colors-text-meta (section labels), $colors-text-body (label).\n• Typography: $typo-primary-base-regular (accounts), $typo-primary-xs-semibold (trigger label).\n• Selected row: $taupe-200. Hover row: $taupe-100.\n• Add Account: $blue-600 (text + icon). Chevron: $gray-400.\n• Spacing/padding: $spacing tokens throughout.\n• No new tokens — reuses existing Hemlock design tokens only.",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "JPBMx",
                      "name": "Accessibility",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Accessibility\n• Inherits Select combobox/listbox roles, keyboard open/close, arrow-key navigation.\n• Section groups use visible uppercase headings for screen readers.\n• Selected state uses both taupe background fill and bold font weight — not color alone.\n• Hover state uses taupe-100 background — distinct from selected taupe-200.\n• Add Account actions have discernible text labels (Add Account +).\n• Chevron icon direction (down/up) communicates open/closed state.\n• Account numbers are consistently masked (••XXXX) for privacy.",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "lDdav",
                      "name": "Resize behavior",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Resize behavior\n• Trigger fills parent width (fill_container).\n• Dropdown width matches trigger width (fill_container).\n• Open variants use fit_content height — the frame grows to contain the full dropdown.\n• Outer component does not clip the dropdown (clip defaults to false).\n• Account rows use fill_container width with text wrapping for long names.\n• Closed variant has fixed height (58px) matching Select trigger.\n• Internal scroll is not used — all accounts are visible.",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "mZmzA",
                      "name": "Implementation note",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Implementation note\n• Open/close state management, focus trapping, keyboard navigation, outside-click dismissal, and account data binding are implementation-level concerns.\n• The dropdown content is a full replacement of Select/open's default option list via the descendants mechanism.\n• Section groupings (Banking, Credit & Loans, Investments) should be dynamic based on the user's linked accounts.\n• Add Account actions should trigger account linking flows.",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
