                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "ufuz6",
                  "name": "AccountRowGroup Documentation",
                  "width": 640,
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 32,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "q2fRo",
                      "name": "Docs Title",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-header",
                      "content": "Account Row Group",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-xl",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-xl",
                      "fontWeight": "700"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "cOw0O",
                      "name": "Docs Subtitle",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-meta",
                      "content": "Organism",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "FKQPc",
                      "name": "Purpose",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Purpose\nGeneric grouped account list organism. Combines a section label with a vertical stack of AccountRow instances and an optional action button. Use for categorized account lists — Banking, Investments, Credit & Loans, etc.\n\nThe base component includes 3 AccountRow slots and a text action button. Instances can add more rows or hide existing ones via enabled:false.",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "LPnWY",
                      "name": "Variants",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Variants\n• default — section label + 3 AccountRow rows + action button\n• /hover — middle row shows $taupe-100 fill with $radius-xs\n• /pressed — middle row shows $taupe-200 fill with $radius-xs\n\nToken usage\n• Group gap: $spacing-xs\n• Section label: $typo-primary-xs-semibold, $colors-text-meta, letterSpacing 2, uppercase\n• Row padding: $spacing-xs\n• Row gap: $spacing-xs\n• Row corner radius: $radius-2xs\n• Title: $typo-primary-sm-semibold, $colors-text-header\n• Subtitle: $typo-primary-xs-regular, $colors-text-meta\n• Caption: $typo-primary-sm-regular (12px), $colors-text-meta\n• Chevron: lucide chevron-right 14×14, $colors-text-header\n• Value: MoneyText/sm — $typo-primary-sm-semibold, $colors-text-header\n• Hover bg: $taupe-100\n• Pressed bg: $taupe-200\n• Action button: Button/text — $blue-600",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "q3tB4",
                      "name": "Composition",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Composition\n\nAccountRowGroup (vertical frame, 640px, gap $spacing-xs)\n  ├ sectionLabel — uppercase text label\n  ├ row1 — AccountRow ref\n  ├ row2 — AccountRow ref\n  ├ row3 — AccountRow ref\n  └ action — Button/text ref (\"Action\" label)\n\nEach AccountRow contains:\n  ├ media — Avatar ref (32×32)\n  ├ content — vertical frame\n  │   ├ titleRow — title text + chevron icon\n  │   ├ subtitle — secondary text\n  │   └ caption — tertiary text\n  └ value — MoneyText/sm ref (right-aligned)",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "ZNAXx",
                      "name": "When to use",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "When to use\n• Account lists grouped by category (Banking, Investments, Credit & Loans)\n• Net Worth screen sections\n• Any vertical list of accounts needing a section header\n• Sections with a contextual action (e.g. \"Add Account\")\n\nWhen NOT to use\n• Single ungrouped lists — use AccountRow directly\n• Table layouts — use TransactionTable or HoldingsTable\n• Card-based groupings — use Card + CardHeader\n\nCustomization\n• Section label: descendants y5ENU → {content: \"BANKING\"}\n• Row title: descendants \"ylniI/cFWeZ\" → {content: \"WF Checking\"}\n• Row subtitle: descendants \"ylniI/AKuhp\" → {content: \"Wells Fargo\"}\n• Row caption: descendants \"ylniI/q44Ur\" → {content: \"Checking ••1234\"}\n• Row value: descendants \"ylniI/b9l3e0\" → {content: \"$12,400.00\"}\n• Row avatar: descendants \"ylniI/apkdH\" — override with Avatar/fallback or Avatar/icon\n• Hide row: descendants AOAwN → {enabled: false}\n• Action label: descendants \"EeY56/YiRTU\" → {content: \"Add Account\"}\n• Hide action: descendants EeY56 → {enabled: false}",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
