                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "DfIQO",
                  "name": "HoldingsTable Documentation",
                  "width": 640,
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 32,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "t7NoJQ",
                      "name": "Docs Title",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-header",
                      "content": "Holdings Table",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-xl",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-xl",
                      "fontWeight": "700"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "s2ZQz",
                      "name": "Docs Subtitle",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-meta",
                      "content": "Organism",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "ISNW9",
                      "name": "Purpose",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Purpose\nInvestment holdings/securities table organism. HoldingsTableHeader + stacked HoldingsRow instances + action button. Use for portfolio views showing security positions with ticker, type, account, value, and allocation %.\n\nBase includes 3 row slots and a text action button. Instances add/remove rows as needed.\n\nWhen to use\n• Investment portfolio holdings page\n• Securities breakdown by account\n• Asset allocation detail views\n• Holding detail drawer — related positions section\n\nWhen NOT to use\n• Transaction history — use TransactionTable\n• Account lists — use AccountRowGroup\n• Key-value details — use DetailSection\n• Single holding row — use HoldingsRow directly",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "kyuyE",
                      "name": "Variants",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Variants\n• default — header + 3 HoldingsRow rows + action button\n• hover — middle row $taupe-100 fill\n• pressed — middle row $taupe-200 fill\n\nRows with Cash Equivalent badge use the tag descendant. Hide tag on non-cash rows via enabled:false.",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "l37m9T",
                      "name": "Composition",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Composition\n\nHoldingsTable (vertical frame, 900px, gap $spacing-2xs, clip true)\n  ├ header — HoldingsTableHeader ref, sortable column labels\n  ├ row1 — HoldingsRow ref\n  ├ row2 — HoldingsRow ref\n  ├ row3 — HoldingsRow ref (last row border disabled)\n  └ action — Button/text ref (\"Action\" label)\n\nEach HoldingsRow contains:\n  ├ colSecurity — fill_container, clipped\n  │   ├ tickerBadge — ticker text + optional Tag ref\n  │   └ securityName — secondary text\n  ├ colType — 70px fixed\n  ├ colAccount — 160px fixed, clipped\n  ├ colValue — 110px, MoneyText/sm ref (right-aligned)\n  └ colPercent — 90px, percent text (right-aligned)\n\nColumns: SECURITY (fill), TYPE (70px), ACCOUNT (160px), MARKET VALUE (110px), PORTFOLIO % (90px).",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "YQOUu",
                      "name": "Tokens",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Token usage\n• Container: clip true, $spacing-2xs gap\n• Header: $taupe-100, $radius-2xs corners, $spacing-3xs/$spacing-sm padding\n• Rows: $spacing-xs padding, $spacing-sm gap, bottom stroke $gray-100\n• Ticker: $typo-primary-sm-semibold, $colors-text-header\n• Security name: $typo-primary-2xs-regular, $colors-text-meta\n• Type / Account / Percent: $typo-primary-sm-regular, $colors-text-meta\n• Value: MoneyText/sm ($typo-primary-sm-semibold, $colors-text-header)\n• Hover: $taupe-100 | Pressed: $taupe-200\n• Action button: Button/text — $blue-600\n\nCustomization\n• Row ticker: descendants \"Xb8XT/tRnXP\" → {content: \"AAPL\"}\n• Row security name: descendants \"Xb8XT/xVnjW\" → {content: \"Apple Inc.\"}\n• Row type: descendants \"Xb8XT/wh0PS\" → {content: \"Equity\"}\n• Row account: descendants \"Xb8XT/OPz1H\" → {content: \"Fidelity ••4372\"}\n• Row market value: descendants \"Xb8XT/b9UbWX\" → {content: \"$58,062.50\"}\n• Row percent: descendants \"Xb8XT/E0oqF\" → {content: \"12.50%\"}\n• Row badge: descendants \"Xb8XT/ni2W7\" — enable/disable or override text via \"Xb8XT/ni2W7/Lf3oy\"\n• Hide row: descendants I9qc3 → {enabled: false}\n• Action label: descendants \"e4LwQ/YiRTU\" → {content: \"View All Holdings\"}\n• Hide action: descendants e4LwQ → {enabled: false}",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "R3UQXd",
              "name": "HoldingsTable Demo Examples Title",
              "fill": "$sem-text-header",
              "content": "HoldingsTable — Demo Examples",
              "lineHeight": "$line-height-xl",
              "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
              "fontSize": "$text-size-xl",
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
