                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "sdGPt",
                      "name": "Purpose",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Purpose\nSingle-option selection control for mutually exclusive choices within a group. Radio is a standalone atom — group composition is handled separately via Stack.",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "pt8XF",
                      "name": "When to use",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "When to use\n• Mutually exclusive options where only one can be selected\n• Settings, preferences, or form fields with 2–5 choices\n• When the selected state must be visible at all times",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "pjXcI",
                      "name": "When not to use",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "When NOT to use\n• Independent on/off toggles (use Checkbox)\n• Binary on/off without adjacent copy (use ToggleSwitch)\n• More than 5 options in tight space (use Select)\n• Navigation or actions that behave like a button",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "CDh33",
                      "name": "Variants",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Variants / defaults (radio.tsx)\n• size: default | small — small adjusts label/helper typography\n• checked: driven by input state — design primitive \"component/Radio/checked\" uses a filled dot inside the 20×20 control\n• error, helperText, children optional; without children the label column is not rendered\n• errorMessage appears below the control row, indented to align with label column",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "TygmD",
                      "name": "Token usage",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Token usage (maps to radio.tsx)\n• Control 20×20, cornerRadius 9999 (fully round)\n• Gap between control and label column: $spacing-xs\n• Border default: $colors-borders-dark (1 px); error: $colors-borders-error; checked: $colors-borders-focus (2 px)\n• Checked dot: 10×10 ellipse, $colors-borders-focus\n• Surface default: $colors-background-surface; error: $red-50; disabled: $colors-background-light\n• Label: typo-primary-base-regular + $colors-text-body; small: typo-primary-sm-regular\n• Helper: typo-primary-sm-light, $colors-text-meta; small: typo-primary-xs-light\n• Error text: typo-primary-sm-semibold + $colors-text-error, indent padding-left 32\n• Disabled: $colors-text-disabled on label and helper",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "tJvhh",
                      "name": "Accessibility",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Accessibility\nRadio must be used inside a radio group in implementation. Each radio should have an accessible label (htmlFor + id), and the group should expose a shared name and fieldset legend. In the error state, set aria-invalid and point aria-describedby at the error text. No-label variants require aria-label on the input.",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
