                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Purpose: Displays formatted code snippets with syntax-aware presentation, language labels, and a copy-to-clipboard action. Based on Ant Design X CodeHighlighter pattern.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "pKApm",
                  "name": "When to use",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When to use\n• Displaying code snippets, config, JSON, shell output\n• LLM-generated code responses\n• Technical documentation examples\n• Copyable configuration blocks",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "WcRJq",
                  "name": "When not",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When NOT to use: For inline code references within body text (use a styled <code> span). For editable code (use a code editor component). For plain preformatted text without language context.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "boOyB",
                  "name": "Variants",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Variants: default (TypeScript, header + copy), json, css, no-header (code only, no header bar), copied (post-copy success state), error (error output with red styling).",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ZLnSh",
                  "name": "Tokens",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Tokens: bg $colors-background-light, header-bg $colors-gray-100, border $colors-borders-light, text $colors-text-header, meta $colors-text-meta, icon $colors-icons-meta, error-bg $colors-red-50, error-border $colors-red-700, error-text $colors-text-error, success $colors-green-600. Font: Source Code Pro (monospace). Radius $radius-3xs, padding $spacing-sm, header-padding [$spacing-2xs, $spacing-sm], gap $spacing-3xs.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Y84cB4",
                  "name": "A11y",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Accessibility\nCodeBlock should preserve whitespace and be readable by assistive technologies. Use a <pre><code> structure in implementation. Copy action must have an accessible label (e.g. aria-label=\"Copy code\"). After copying, announce the state change to screen readers via aria-live.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
