            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "kGfQr",
              "name": "Tag Documentation",
              "width": 640,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": "$spacing-lg",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "G95umX",
                  "name": "Docs Title",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-header",
                  "content": "Tag",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-xl",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-xl",
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "mB7oj",
                  "name": "Docs Subtitle",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-meta",
                  "content": "Status Indicator Atom",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "YtcAT",
                  "name": "Purpose",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Purpose\nNon-interactive visual indicator used to label, categorize, or communicate status. Tags provide at-a-glance information about an item's state, type, or category.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "mmTyM",
                  "name": "When to use",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When to use\n• Displaying item categories or labels\n• Showing status (pending, error, active)\n• Filtering or grouping related content\n• Inline metadata next to titles or descriptions",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "RD9K3",
                  "name": "When not",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When NOT to use\n• Interactive toggle actions (use Toggle or Button)\n• Navigation (use Link or Breadcrumb)\n• Dismissible notifications (use Alert or Toast)\n• Input selection (use Checkbox or Radio)",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "RUrgO",
                  "name": "Variants",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Variants & defaults\n• size: small (default) · large\n• iconPosition: none (default) · left · right\n• state: default · positive · negative · error · disabled\n\n6 primitive structural variants:\n  small/default · small/icon-left · small/icon-right\n  large/default · large/icon-left · large/icon-right\n\nStates (positive, negative, error, disabled) are expressed via instance overrides on any structural variant — not as separate components.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "fEehq",
                  "name": "Tokens",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Token usage\n• Small bg: $blue-100, text: $blue-700, radius $radius-3xs, padding [4, 8], typo-primary-xs-regular\n• Large: same bg/text + 1 px inside stroke, padding [4, 12], typo-primary-sm-regular\n• Icon (small): 12 × 12 lucide, fill matches text color\n• Icon (large): 16 × 16 lucide, fill matches text color\n• Left icon: eye · Right icon: x (dismiss)\n• Gap: $spacing-3xs (4 px)\n\nState overrides (applied on instance):\n• Positive: $green-50 bg, $colors-text-deposit text/icon, arrow-up icon\n• Negative: $red-50 bg, $colors-text-error text/icon, arrow-down icon\n• Error: $red-50 bg, $colors-text-body-error text\n• Disabled: $gray-50 bg, $colors-text-disabled text",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "MToDX",
                  "name": "A11y",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Accessibility\nTag is visually informative and non-interactive. If used as meaningful status content, implementation should expose the information to assistive technologies via aria-label or role=\"status\".",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
