              "width": 640,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": "$spacing-lg",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "bXlQw",
                  "name": "Docs Title",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-header",
                  "content": "Select",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-xl",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-xl",
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "bcl51",
                  "name": "Docs Subtitle",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-meta",
                  "content": "Form Control Atom",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "uNVwK",
                  "name": "Purpose",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Purpose\nSingle-value picker built on the Input primitive. Presents a trigger that opens a dropdown list of options. The trigger inherits all visual properties from Input (height, border, radius, typography).",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "xSSSP",
                  "name": "When to use",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When to use\n• Choosing one value from a predefined list (account type, currency)\n• Form fields where free text is not appropriate\n• Replacing native browser selects with a styled alternative",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "M7jzJ",
                  "name": "When not",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When NOT to use\n• Multi-select (use Checkbox group or multi-select pattern)\n• Fewer than 3 options (use Radio group)\n• Searchable/filterable lists (use Combobox / Autocomplete)\n• Navigation or actions (use Menu or Button)",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "GBG1a",
                  "name": "Variants",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Variants & defaults\n• state: default (default) · open · hover · focus · disabled · error\n• value: empty (default) · selected\n• label: none (default) · floating\n\n8 component variants:\n  Select · Select/selected · Select/open · Select/hover\n  Select/focus · Select/disabled · Select/error · Select/floating-label\n\nTrigger inherits Input visual foundation. Dropdown only exists in open and hover variants.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "fw2QG",
                  "name": "Tokens",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Token usage\n• Trigger: 320 × 58, $radius-3xs radius, $colors-background-surface bg\n• Border: inside 1 px $colors-borders-dark (default), 2 px $colors-borders-focus (focus/open)\n• Disabled: $gray-50 bg, $gray-300 border, $colors-text-disabled text\n• Error: $red-50 bg, $red-700 border, $colors-text-error message\n• Placeholder: $colors-text-meta, typo-primary-base-regular\n• Floating label: $colors-text-body, typo-primary-xs-semibold, y 12\n• Value: $colors-text-header, typo-primary-base-regular, y 28 (label) / y 18 (no label)\n• Chevron: 20 × 20 lucide, $gray-400 (disabled: $colors-text-disabled)\n• Dropdown: $base-white, $radius-2xs radius, inside 1 px $colors-borders-dark, $shadow-md-* tokens (outer shadow), z-index $z-dropdown (100)\n• Options: padding [8, 36, 8, 12], hover bg $gray-50\n• Dropdown transition: open = $duration-base + $easing-enter; close = $duration-base + $easing-exit",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "hjboT",
                  "name": "A11y",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Accessibility\nSelect should expose a clear accessible label, support keyboard navigation (arrow keys to move, Enter to select, Escape to close), and announce the selected option to assistive technologies. Implementation should use Listbox pattern with appropriate ARIA roles.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
