            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "BBL3v",
              "name": "TabItem Documentation",
              "width": 640,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": "$spacing-lg",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "eNU8r",
                  "name": "Docs Title",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-header",
                  "content": "TabItem",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-xl",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-xl",
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "eRiDu",
                  "name": "Docs Subtitle",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-meta",
                  "content": "Navigation Atom",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Y2PwN",
                  "name": "Purpose",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Purpose\nA single underline-style tab used for switching between content views. TabItem is a standalone atom composed inside a TabsGroup molecule (P2). Hover and selected states use blue accent text ($colors-btnLinkText) with a 2 px bottom indicator that spans the full tab container width.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Cq1QC",
                  "name": "When to use",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When to use\n• Switching between sibling content panels\n• Filtering dashboard views (Overview, Transactions, Portfolio)\n• Any context where exactly one view is active at a time",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "sHDuB",
                  "name": "When not",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When NOT to use\n• Page-level navigation (use NavItem or Link)\n• Toggling a boolean state (use ToggleSwitch)\n• Actions or commands (use Button)\n• Selecting from a list of values (use Select or Radio)",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "nJOuS",
                  "name": "Variants",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Variants & defaults\n• state: default (default) · hover · selected · disabled\n• size: md (only size for now)\n\n4 component variants:\n  TabItem · TabItem/hover · TabItem/selected · TabItem/disabled\n\nDefault uses $colors-text-body with no indicator. Hover and selected use $colors-btnLinkText (blue) text with a full-width 2 px bottom indicator ($radius-full). Selected adds semibold weight. Disabled uses $colors-text-disabled with no indicator. No pill background or border on any state.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "eOGpT",
                  "name": "Tokens",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Token usage\n• Height: 40 px\n• Default / Disabled: padding [8, 16], horizontal layout, text centered\n• Hover / Selected: padding [10, 0, 0, 0], vertical layout, text centered via alignItems\n• Default: no bg, no border, text $colors-text-body, typo-primary-sm-regular\n• Hover: no bg, text $colors-btnLinkText, 2 px indicator $colors-btnLinkText, $radius-full, full container width\n• Selected: no bg, text $colors-btnLinkText, typo-primary-sm-semibold, 2 px indicator $colors-btnLinkText, $radius-full, full container width\n• Disabled: no bg, no border, text $colors-text-disabled\n• Transitions: hover/selected = $duration-fast + $easing-standard",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "azrGG",
                  "name": "A11y",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Accessibility\nTabItem should be implemented as part of a tablist pattern with role=\"tab\", aria-selected state, and keyboard navigation (arrow keys to move between tabs, Enter/Space to activate). Each tab must be associated with its panel via aria-controls.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "H4RyRd",
          "name": "TabItem Demo Examples Title",
