            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "o8mxDR",
              "name": "CardHeader Documentation",
              "width": 640,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": "$spacing-lg",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "K2iCAz",
                  "name": "Docs Title",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-header",
                  "content": "CardHeader",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-xl",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-xl",
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Kt2rR",
                  "name": "Docs Subtitle",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-meta",
                  "content": "Header Region Molecule",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "nXzM8",
                  "name": "Purpose",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Purpose\nHeader region for Card. Provides a consistent title area with optional description, action slot, and divider — ensuring Cards have a uniform top section across the product.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "gwzZT",
                  "name": "When to use",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When to use\n• Title a Card or content section\n• Add a description below the title for context\n• Provide an inline action (button, link, icon) beside the title\n• Visually separate the header from the card body with a divider",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "kFspX",
                  "name": "When not to use",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When NOT to use\n• Page-level headings (use a dedicated PageHeader component)\n• Modal or dialog titles (use Dialog's built-in header)\n• Standalone headings outside a Card context\n• Section headers that need navigation tabs (use Tabs)",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "xzLYs",
                  "name": "Variants",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Variants / Defaults\n• description: false | true  →  false\n• action: false | true  →  false\n• divider: false | true  →  false\n• density: default | dense  →  default\n\nVariant naming:\n• /description — title + description\n• /action — title + action slot\n• /description-action — title + description + action\n• /divider — title + divider below\n• /dense — compact density (smaller type)",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Vw8sh",
                  "name": "Token usage",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Token usage\n• Title = Label component ($typo-primary-md-semibold, $colors-text-header)\n• Description = TextContent component ($typo-primary-base-regular, $colors-text-meta)\n• Divider = Separator component ($colors-borders-light)\n• Gap title → description = $spacing-2xs (8 px)\n• Gap content → divider = $spacing-sm (16 px)\n• Dense title = $typo-primary-xs-semibold (12 px)",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "klJAT",
                  "name": "Accessibility",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Accessibility\nCardHeader title should use the correct heading level (h2–h6) in implementation, determined by the page's heading hierarchy. The component itself does not enforce a heading level — the consuming code must set the appropriate level. Action slots should be keyboard-accessible and have descriptive labels.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
