            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "xWTmW",
              "name": "SegmentedControl Documentation",
              "width": 640,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 32,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "PpcDc",
                  "name": "Docs Title",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-header",
                  "content": "SegmentedControl",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-xl",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-xl",
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "y0CIqp",
                  "name": "Docs Subtitle",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-meta",
                  "content": "Segmented Selection Molecule",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "axN5u",
                  "name": "Purpose",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Purpose\nA pill-shaped container holding 2–4 SegmentItem atoms for mutually exclusive selection. The selected item appears as a raised white pill with shadow over the gray ($gray-100) track. Unlike TabsGroup (underline navigation for content panels), SegmentedControl is for compact value/mode switching — e.g. time periods, view modes, or filter presets.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "h92Ge",
                  "name": "When to use",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When to use\n• Switching between 2–4 mutually exclusive modes within a compact control\n• Time-period selectors (Monthly / Quarterly / Yearly)\n• View mode toggles (Grid / List, Day / Week / Month)\n• Filter presets in toolbars or card headers\n• Any place where all options should be simultaneously visible",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "GKoic",
                  "name": "When not to use",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When NOT to use\n• Page-level or section-level navigation (use TabsGroup)\n• More than 4–5 options (use Select or RadioGroup)\n• Boolean on/off toggle (use ToggleSwitch)\n• Multi-select filtering (use Tags or Checkboxes)\n• Actions or commands (use Button)\n• Long-label options that won't fit in a compact pill",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "N2p9AN",
                  "name": "Variants",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Variants & defaults\n• itemCount: 2 | 3 | 4  →  3\n• selected: first | middle | last  →  first\n• disabledItem: false | true  →  false\n\n7 component variants:\n  SegmentedControl (3 items, first selected)\n  /2-items · /mid-selected · /last-selected\n  /4-items · /fill (400 px) · /with-disabled\n\nHug variants: outer container hugs its content. Each SegmentItem sizes to its label text plus padding. Width varies with label length.\n\nFill variant (/fill): outer container has a fixed width (400 px). Each SegmentItem uses fill_container to distribute evenly. The selected state fills the full segment width.\n\nTo create a fill-width instance of any variant, override both the SegmentedControl width and each child SegmentItem width to fill_container.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "VGAtC",
                  "name": "Token usage",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Token usage\n• Outer container: fill $taupe-100, cornerRadius $radius-full, padding $spacing-3xs (4 px), gap 0\n• Layout: horizontal, alignItems center\n• Height: 48 px (SegmentItem 40 px + 4 px top/bottom padding)\n• Hug variants: no explicit width, children hug text content\n• Fill variant: width 400 px, children width fill_container\n• Selected pill: fill $colors-background-surface (white), cornerRadius $radius-full\n• Selected shadow: $shadow-sm ($shadow-sm-y / $shadow-sm-blur / $shadow-sm-color)\n• Selected text: $colors-text-header, typo-primary-sm-semibold\n• Default text: $colors-text-body, typo-primary-sm-regular\n• Hover text: $colors-text-header, typo-primary-sm-regular\n• Disabled text: $colors-text-disabled, typo-primary-sm-regular\n• Each SegmentItem: height 40 px, padding [0, $spacing-md], cornerRadius $radius-full\n• Transitions: $duration-fast + $easing-standard\n\nTabsGroup = underline navigation for switching content panels.\nSegmentedControl = pill container for mutually exclusive mode/value selection.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ucUvg",
                  "name": "Accessibility",
                  "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Accessibility\nSegmentedControl maps to a radiogroup (role=\"radiogroup\") with each SegmentItem as role=\"radio\" and aria-checked. Alternatively, use the tablist/tab pattern if segments switch content panels. Keyboard: arrow keys to move between segments, Enter/Space to activate. Disabled segments have aria-disabled=\"true\" and are skipped by arrow-key navigation. The container should have an accessible label via aria-label or aria-labelledby.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "uiIFO",
