                      "name": "Variants",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Variants\n• default — Image atom ref inside 32×32 clipped frame. Override the Image descendant to set the photo/logo.\n• fallback — Centered initials (up to 2 chars) on $gray-200 background. Override initials text per instance.\n• icon — Centered Lucide icon on $gray-200 background. Override icon name per instance (building-2, user, etc.).",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "Qr6aw",
                      "name": "Composition",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Composition\n• Base frame: 32×32, clip: true, cornerRadius: $radius-2xs\n• default: Image atom ref (jqmad) sized to 32×32 with cornerRadius 0 (parent clips)\n• fallback: text node centered with $typo-primary-xs-semibold, fill $colors-text-body, on $gray-200 bg\n• icon: 16×16 Lucide icon centered, fill $colors-text-meta, on $gray-200 bg",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "rSRjg",
                      "name": "Token usage",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Token usage\n• Size: 32×32 (fixed)\n• Corners: $radius-2xs\n• Fallback bg: $gray-200\n• Fallback text: $colors-text-body, $typo-primary-xs-semibold\n• Icon: $colors-text-meta, 16×16\n• No new tokens needed",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
