                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "PLgF1",
                  "name": "HoldingsRow Documentation",
                  "width": 640,
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 32,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "Mp9co",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-header",
                      "content": "Holdings Row",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-xl",
                      "fontWeight": "700"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "PGuxy",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-meta",
                      "content": "Generic Molecule",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "YutiO",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Purpose\nGeneric table row for investment holdings data. Five columns: security (ticker + optional badge + name), type, account, market value, and portfolio percentage. Bottom divider separates rows. Used as the repeating row inside HoldingsTable organism.\n\nWhen to use\n• Investment portfolio holdings list\n• Securities breakdown tables\n• Asset allocation detail views\n• Any tabular data with ticker, type, account, value, and weight columns\n\nWhen NOT to use\n• Transaction history — use TransactionRow\n• Account list — use AccountRow\n• Key-value detail pairs — use DetailRow\n• Non-tabular content — use ListRow or Card",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "GvNgS",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Variants\n• default — standard row with bottom border divider\n• /hover — $taupe-100 background, $radius-xs corners\n• /pressed — $taupe-200 background, $radius-xs corners\n• HoldingsTableHeader — companion header component with column labels and sort icons\n\nComposition\n\nHoldingsRow (horizontal frame, 900px, center-aligned)\n  ├ colSecurity — fill_container, vertical, clipped\n  │   ├ tickerBadge — horizontal\n  │   │   ├ ticker text — \"TICKER\", $typo-primary-sm-semibold\n  │   │   └ tag — Tag ref (optional badge)\n  │   └ securityName text — \"Security Name\", $typo-primary-2xs\n  ├ colType — 70px fixed\n  │   └ type text\n  ├ colAccount — 160px fixed, clipped\n  │   └ account text\n  ├ colValue — 110px fixed, right-aligned\n  │   └ marketValue — MoneyText/sm ref\n  └ colPercent — 90px fixed, right-aligned\n      └ percent text\n\nToken usage\n• Row padding: $spacing-xs\n• Column gap: $spacing-sm\n• Bottom border: $gray-100 (1px inner)\n• Ticker: $typo-primary-sm-semibold, $colors-text-header\n• Security name: $typo-primary-2xs-regular, $colors-text-meta\n• Type / Account / Percent: $typo-primary-sm-regular, $colors-text-meta\n• Market value: MoneyText/sm ($typo-primary-sm-semibold, $colors-text-header)\n• Tag badge: $typo-primary-2xs-semibold\n• Hover bg: $taupe-100, radius $radius-xs\n• Pressed bg: $taupe-200, radius $radius-xs\n\nCustomization\n• Override ticker: descendants tRnXP → {content: \"AAPL\"}\n• Override security name: descendants xVnjW → {content: \"Apple Inc.\"}\n• Override type: descendants wh0PS → {content: \"Equity\"}\n• Override account: descendants OPz1H → {content: \"Fidelity ••4372\"}\n• Override market value: descendants b9UbWX → {content: \"$58,062.50\"}\n• Override percent: descendants E0oqF → {content: \"12.50%\"}\n• Hide badge tag: descendants ni2W7 → {enabled: false}\n• Override badge text: descendants \"ni2W7/Lf3oy\" → {content: \"NEW\"}",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "gl2dh",
              "fill": "$sem-text-header",
              "content": "HoldingsRow — Demo Examples",
              "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
              "fontSize": "$text-size-xl",
              "fontWeight": "700"
