                  "width": 640,
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 32,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "D7VUHt",
                      "name": "Title",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-header",
                      "content": "Detail Section",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-xl",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-xl",
                      "fontWeight": "700"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "A2Wld5",
                      "name": "Subtitle",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-meta",
                      "content": "Molecule",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "X5babT",
                      "name": "Purpose",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Purpose\nA section container for grouped key-value data inside detail drawers. Combines a labeled header bar, a configurable list of DetailRow slots, and an optional action button. Used to organize related fields (account details, balances, transaction info, classification) into visually distinct groups.\n\nWhen to use\n• Grouping related key-value fields inside a detail drawer or panel\n• Account details, balances, transaction metadata, holding info\n• Any section that needs a titled header with rows of Label / Value pairs\n• Sections that need a contextual CTA (e.g. \"View All Activity\")\n\nWhen NOT to use\n• Standalone card content — use Card + CardHeader instead\n• Lists of navigable items — use ListRow or AccountRow\n• Free-form body text — use SectionBlock or TextContent\n• Tables with sortable columns — use TransactionTable or HoldingsTable\n\nComposition\n\nDetailSection (vertical frame, width: fill_container)\n  └ sectionHeader — header bar with background\n      └ sectionTitle — text label\n  └ row1 — DetailRow ref (enabled)\n  └ row2 — DetailRow ref (enabled)\n  └ row3 — DetailRow ref (enabled)\n  └ row4 — DetailRow ref (disabled by default)\n  └ row5 — DetailRow ref (disabled by default)\n  └ row6 — DetailRow ref (disabled by default)\n  └ row7 — DetailRow ref (disabled by default)\n  └ actionButton — Button/text/icon-right ref (disabled by default)\n\nToken usage\n• Header background: $taupe-100\n• Header border: $colors-borders-light (bottom 1px, inner)\n• Header corner radius: $radius-2xs (top-left, top-right)\n• Header padding: [$spacing-xs, $spacing-sm]\n• Section title: $typo-primary-sm-semibold, $colors-text-header\n• Action button: $blue-600, $typo-primary-base, icon arrow-right\n• Action button padding: [$spacing-xs, $spacing-sm]\n\nCustomization\n• Override sectionTitle content via descendants: {mD16B: {content: \"...\"}}\n• Override row Label/Value: {\"rowId/o8uVfY\": {content: \"...\"}, \"rowId/gTlHs\": {content: \"...\"}}\n• Enable extra rows: {G4HSVO: {enabled: true}} through {P8knJ9: {enabled: true}}\n• Remove last row border: override stroke enabled:false on the bottom row\n• Replace row type: use descendants with type to swap a base DetailRow for a transaction variant\n• Enable action button: {vXTx9: {enabled: true}} and override label: {\"vXTx9/PwKh4\": {content: \"View All\"}}",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
