                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "name": "When To Use",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "Use Carousel for browsing a small set (3–8 items) of related media or content cards. Choose image-with-caption when slides need descriptive text. Use multi-card when presenting collections of structured content. Wrap in with-header when the carousel needs a title or description. Use controls-disabled-start/end to show boundary states at the first or last slide."
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
