                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "Shows part-to-whole distribution using a circular ring chart with 15 categorical segments and visible angular gaps. Displays account allocation using chart-categorical color tokens color-01 through color-15, a center MoneyText value, and a center label. Built on Card with donut ring using ellipse segments with innerRadius:0.55. Default state shows all segments muted; hover/pressed highlight one segment at full opacity."
                    }
