                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "Use for portfolio allocation, account breakdown, asset mix, or any part-to-whole distribution across up to 15 categories. Use hover to show tooltip on segment interaction. Use pressed to highlight a selected segment. Use static-filled when no interaction state is needed. Use with-legend when categories need explicit labels. Use compact in dense dashboards."
                    }
                  }
                },
