                      "content": "DonutChart = Card ref + donutContent (frame, vertical, alignItems:center) + donutRing (frame, layout:none, 200×200). DonutRing contains 15 ellipse segments (200×200, innerRadius:0.55, varying startAngle/sweepAngle with 2.5° gaps) and a centerGroup frame (absolute, 100×100, centered in the inner circle). Center contains MoneyText/lg ref and label text. With-legend adds a 2-column legend frame below the ring. Hover adds ChartTooltip ref positioned absolutely."
                    }
                  }
                },
