                  "ref": "i5vQ3i",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "descendants": {
                    "FHA10": {
                      "content": "Primary line: $chart-categorical/color-01 (solid stroke). Secondary dots: $chart-categorical/color-02. Left Y-axis labels: color-01. Right Y-axis labels: $colors-text-meta. X-axis labels: $colors-text-meta. Event markers: color-04 (Exercise), color-02 (Sale). Legend markers match series colors. Grid: $colors-borders-light. Axis: $colors-borders-dark. Labels: $typo-primary-2xs-regular. Tooltip uses ChartTooltip tokens — monetary value ($195K) uses MoneyText, score value (75) uses plain text. Tooltip marker colors match series: color-01 (Portfolio Value), color-02 (Confidence Score), color-04 (Event)."
                    }
                  }
                },
