                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "Q0qWfg",
                  "name": "TransactionTable Documentation",
                  "width": 640,
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 32,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "TuCtp",
                      "name": "Docs Title",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-header",
                      "content": "Transaction Table",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-xl",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-xl",
                      "fontWeight": "700"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "XXITm",
                      "name": "Docs Subtitle",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-meta",
                      "content": "Organism",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "C85mq",
                      "name": "Purpose",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Purpose\nTransaction history table organism. Combines TransactionTableHeader with stacked TransactionRow instances and an action button inside a rounded-corner container. Used for activity feeds and transaction lists.\n\nBase includes 3 row slots and a text action button. Instances add/remove rows as needed.\n\nWhen to use\n• Transaction history / activity feed pages\n• Account detail drawer — recent transactions section\n• Search results for transactions\n• Any tabular list with date, description, category, account, and amount columns\n\nWhen NOT to use\n• Investment holdings — use HoldingsTable\n• Account lists — use AccountRowGroup\n• Key-value data — use DetailSection\n• Non-tabular transaction lists — use DetailRow/transaction-negative or positive",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "M5te0",
                      "name": "Variants",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Variants\n• default — header + 3 TransactionRow rows + action button\n• /hover — middle row $taupe-100 fill\n• /pressed — middle row $taupe-200 fill\n\nFor pending transactions, use TransactionRow/pending variant in specific row slots.",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "G01i25",
                      "name": "Composition",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Composition\n\nTransactionTable (vertical frame, 900px, gap $spacing-2xs, clip true)\n  ├ header — TransactionTableHeader ref, $radius-2xs corners\n  ├ row1 — TransactionRow ref\n  ├ row2 — TransactionRow ref\n  ├ row3 — TransactionRow ref (last row border disabled)\n  └ action — Button/text ref (\"Action\" label)\n\nEach TransactionRow contains:\n  ├ dateBlock — vertical: month (2xs) + day (md-semibold)\n  ├ avatar — Avatar ref (32×32)\n  ├ description — text (sm-semibold)\n  ├ category — text (sm, meta)\n  ├ account — text (sm, meta)\n  └ amount — MoneyText ref (right-aligned)\n\nColumns: DATE (44px), DESCRIPTION (fill), CATEGORY (130px), ACCOUNT (140px), AMOUNT (100px).",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "kyQYJ",
                      "name": "Tokens",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Token usage\n• Container: $radius-xs corners (not applied — use cornerRadius on header), clip true, gap $spacing-2xs\n• Header: TransactionTableHeader — $taupe-100 fill, $spacing-xs padding, $radius-2xs\n• Rows: $spacing-xs padding, $spacing-sm gap, bottom stroke $gray-100\n• Hover: $taupe-100 row fill\n• Pressed: $taupe-200 row fill\n• Date month: $typo-primary-2xs-regular, $colors-text-meta\n• Date day: $typo-primary-md-semibold, $colors-text-header\n• Description: $typo-primary-sm-semibold, $colors-text-header\n• Category / Account: $typo-primary-sm-regular, $colors-text-meta\n• Amount: MoneyText atom ($typo-primary-base-semibold)\n• Action button: Button/text — $blue-600\n\nCustomization\n• Row date month: descendants \"o61xk/gkpoP\" → {content: \"MAY\"}\n• Row date day: descendants \"o61xk/Ie1te\" → {content: \"13\"}\n• Row avatar: descendants \"o61xk/hQlJG\" — override with Avatar/fallback\n• Row description: descendants \"o61xk/El0Cc\" → {content: \"Costco\"}\n• Row category: descendants \"o61xk/r8SUJi\" → {content: \"Groceries\"}\n• Row account: descendants \"o61xk/ICCrN\" → {content: \"WF Checking\"}\n• Row amount: descendants \"o61xk/fybdm\" → {content: \"-$151.55\"}\n• Hide row: descendants tlTNJ → {enabled: false}\n• Pending row: replace row ref with TransactionRow/pending variant\n• Action label: descendants \"wwXmA/YiRTU\" → {content: \"View All Transactions\"}\n• Hide action: descendants wwXmA → {enabled: false}",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "dCniV",
              "name": "TransactionTable Demo Examples Title",
              "fill": "$sem-text-header",
              "content": "TransactionTable — Demo Examples",
              "lineHeight": "$line-height-xl",
              "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
              "fontSize": "$text-size-xl",
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
