                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "M3y22",
                  "name": "DetailDrawer Documentation",
                  "width": 640,
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 32,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "JRRdk",
                      "name": "Docs Title",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-header",
                      "content": "Detail Drawer",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-xl",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-xl",
                      "fontWeight": "700"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "Y7opw1",
                      "name": "Docs Subtitle",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-meta",
                      "content": "Organism",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "IesY7",
                      "name": "Purpose",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Purpose\nAccount/transaction/holding detail drawer organism. ModalDrawer instance with DetailHeader in header slot. Body shows current balance (eyebrow + MoneyText/lg), detail rows (DetailSection refs), and a CTA container with action button.\n\nDesktop uses centered 560px panel. Mobile uses bottom sheet 375px panel.\n\nWhen to use\n• Account detail sidepanel opened from account list or dashboard\n• Transaction detail view from transaction table row tap\n• Holding/security detail view from holdings table row tap\n• Any entity detail that follows header → balance → sections → CTA pattern\n\nWhen NOT to use\n• Simple confirmations or alerts — use Dialog/Modal instead\n• Form editing workflows — build a form-specific drawer\n• Content that doesn't follow the header + sections pattern — use ModalDrawer directly\n• Inline expansion — use Accordion or Collapse",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "oRyGZ",
                      "name": "Variants",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Variants\n• desktop — ModalDrawer (960×640), centered panel 560×480\n• mobile — ModalDrawer/mobile (375×812), bottom sheet panel\n\nBody sections are scrollable within the panel. Instances override DetailHeader (avatar + title), balance value, detail rows, and recent activity with account-specific data.",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "ccZOf",
                      "name": "Composition",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Composition\nDetailDrawer (ref → ModalDrawer EUtXY)\n├── headerSlot → DetailHeader (ref → LIkiw)\n│   ├── avatar (ref → Avatar hxzSk), 36×36\n│   └── title (text), $font-family-secondary, 600\n├── bodySlot → bodyContent (frame, vertical, gap $spacing-md)\n│   ├── balanceDisplay (frame, vertical, gap $spacing-2xs)\n│   │   ├── balanceLabel (text) — \"CURRENT BALANCE\", $typo-primary-2xs-regular, letterSpacing 1.5\n│   │   └── balanceValue (ref → MoneyText/lg LMwn2)\n│   ├── detailsSection (ref → DetailSection pKk6B) — key-value detail rows\n│   ├── balancesSection (ref → DetailSection pKk6B) — financial balance rows\n│   └── CTA container (frame, vertical, padding [0, $spacing-sm])\n│       └── Button/text/icon-right — action link (chevron-right icon)\n\nDetailDrawer/mobile (ref → ModalDrawer/mobile ItINN)\n└── Same body structure, adapted to mobile panel\n\nInherited ModalDrawer tokens:\nDesktop — root [$spacing-xl, 0], header [$spacing-xl, $spacing-lg, 0, $spacing-xl], body $spacing-xl\nMobile — root [$spacing-xl, 0, 0, 0], header [$spacing-md, $spacing-xs, 0, $spacing-sm], body $spacing-sm",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "mjnVs",
                      "name": "Tokens",
                      "fill": "$sem-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Token usage\n• Panel: $colors-background-surface, $radius-sm corners, $shadow-overlay\n• Desktop header: [$spacing-xl, $spacing-lg, 0, $spacing-xl] padding\n• Mobile header: [$spacing-md, $spacing-xs, 0, $spacing-sm] padding\n• Desktop body: $spacing-xl padding\n• Mobile body: $spacing-sm padding\n• Body content gap: $spacing-md\n• Balance label: $typo-primary-2xs-regular, $colors-text-meta, letterSpacing 1.5\n• Balance value: MoneyText/lg ref\n• Detail rows: DetailRow refs inside DetailSection, $colors-borders-light bottom stroke\n• CTA container: padding [0, $spacing-sm], Button/text/icon-right, $blue-600\n\nCustomization (desktop IaBSN)\n• Header avatar: m7iNJ/Y6Ui3z — override Avatar image/fallback\n• Header title: m7iNJ/hGw97 — override content for entity name\n• Balance label: kQlS0 — override content (e.g. \"CURRENT BALANCE\", \"MARKET VALUE\")\n• Balance value: T7Cqk — override content on MoneyText/lg\n• Details section title: J8X85g/mD16B — override content\n• Details row 1–3: J8X85g/z6DUjd, J8X85g/r2Dro, J8X85g/i79sZE — override label/value via DetailRow descendants\n• Details row 4–7: J8X85g/G4HSVO, J8X85g/tGI7G, J8X85g/HxyKK, J8X85g/P8knJ9 — enable with enabled: true\n• Details action: J8X85g/vXTx9 — enable with enabled: true\n• Balances section title: HktRE/mD16B — override content\n• CTA button label: v7pca — override content (e.g. \"View All Activity\")\n• CTA button icon: jHwHf — override icon name\n\nCustomization (mobile XXOX1)\n• Header avatar: j5Fvx9/Y6Ui3z\n• Header title: j5Fvx9/hGw97\n• Balance label: T8qOg\n• Balance value: bNm5O\n• Details section title: qIpe0/mD16B\n• Balances section title: X0AEO/mD16B\n• CTA button label: mFusN\n• CTA button icon: pJLDa",
                      "lineHeight": "$line-height-sm",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
                      "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "jEkym",
              "name": "AccountDetailDrawer Demo Title",
              "fill": "$sem-text-header",
              "content": "DetailDrawer — Demo Examples",
              "lineHeight": "$line-height-xl",
              "fontFamily": "$font-primary",
